rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'A counter is placed on every player’s upkeep, not just the controller’s upkeep.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The controller of the dead creature chooses the new creature.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'When the enchanted creature leaves the battlefield, this card is placed into the graveyard as is normal for an Aura when it loses what it enchants. The triggered ability returns this card to the battlefield with no counters on it.'}, {'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'In Two-Headed Giant, triggers only once per upkeep, not once for each player.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'A creature with no color does not gain any Protection ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'A spell or ability that asks for a sacrifice will not trigger this card.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If an opponent destroys Karmic Justice, it will trigger on its own destruction.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Karmic Justice will not trigger if an opponent’s spell or ability causes your permanent to be destroyed indirectly. For example, if the spell caused an ability you control to trigger, and thereby destroy your permanent.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Karmic Justice will not trigger off of its ability destroying a permanent since you destroy the permanent and you are not one of your opponents.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Everything about the original spell is copied, including any decisions made on announcement, such as whether it was kicked or its Buyback cost was paid. Effects on the spell, such as Sleight of Mind or Flashback, are not copied.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the copied spell requires a target and there are no legal targets, then the copy has the same target (which should be illegal) as the original.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the spell is countered before the triggered ability resolves, then the ability will make a copy of how the spell looked right before it was countered.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It triggers once per spell, so you can’t get multiple copies of a spell using this card. And since this card is legendary, you can’t control more than one.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The copy is not “cast” so it will not trigger anything that triggers on a spell being cast.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You are not required to choose new targets. If you do choose, then the targets must be legal. If you don’t change them, the spell is placed on the stack whether or not the targets are legal. The legality of the targets is always checked on resolution of the spell, so the spell may be countered at that time if all of its targets are illegal.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose whether or not to pay when the triggered ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If Threshold is met, this card is white. It is not white and black.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the creature is not still on the battlefield at beginning of the End step, then you do not return this card to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'This card has received errata such that putting a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield is now optional. This means you no longer need a third-party to verify that you don’t have any creature cards in your hand if you don’t put something onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the creature regenerated during the turn, and thereby had all damage on it removed, the damage before it regenerated was still dealt that turn and will be counted.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This counts all damage that was dealt during the turn. This does not include any damage that was prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the creature regenerates, the fuse counters are still removed and the four damage is still dealt.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If there are two Bomb Squads on the battlefield when a creature ends up with 4 or more fuse counters, both Bomb Squad abilities will trigger causing 4 damage each even though the first to resolve will destroy the creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If there is no legal place to move the enchantment, then it doesn’t move but you still control it.'}, {'date': '2007-07-15', 'text': 'Aura Graft’s effect has no duration. You’ll retain control of the Aura until the game ends, the Aura leaves the battlefield, or an effect causes someone else to gain control of the Aura.'}, {'date': '2007-07-15', 'text': 'You can target an Aura you already control just to move that Aura to a new permanent.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If this card leaves the battlefield after it triggers but before it resolves, then the trigger will deal damage and destroy the land, but it will not bring this card back to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Moving this card to another land does not target the land.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'If there are no other lands to move it to, this card goes to the graveyard as would any Aura that lost the thing it enchants.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you were going to gain life and you also have a replacement that can turn card drawing into life gain on the battlefield, you can gain life by using the Lich to turn the original life gain into card drawing, and then using the other replacement to turn a card draw into life gain. Nefarious Lich will not replace the life gain with a card draw again because it has already acted on this event.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This card will not prevent you from losing the game due to zero or less life.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It only works once. If someone casts another spell after it triggers, but before that trigger resolves, then it will trigger again. The first time one of these triggers resolves, it will be sacrificed for the full effect. Any additional triggers on the stack will do nothing when they resolve because you will be unable to sacrifice it additional times.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Multiple creatures going to the graveyard at the same time all end up there at once, so either all of them or none of them will cause the trigger to go off, depending on whether or not Threshold was met prior to the creatures going to the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability in Threshold will trigger only if Threshold was met before the creature goes to the graveyard. So the one that causes Threshold to be met will not trigger the ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Note that the damage is replaced and is not “prevented”. This means it can replace damage that “can’t be prevented”.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Remember that the creature does not gain Haste, so you can’t attack with that creature or use any ability with {T} in the activation cost during the turn you take control of it.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The creature does not untap if it is tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Since the cost does not include the {T} symbol, it can tap itself even on the turn it enters the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The Legend rule only applies to two legendary permanents with identical names. If the names are different, even if they depict the same character, the rule does not apply.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability is still a mana ability (and doesn’t use the stack) even though you can only activate it when you could cast an instant.'}, {'date': '2005-11-01', 'text': 'If you flip over a hybrid card, you get one of either color mana, not both, for each mana symbol.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability won’t stop lands from being put onto the battlefield by a spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability won’t stop players from activating the abilities of lands. It only stops land cards from being played.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The permanent affected by this ability can’t be targeted by instant and sorcery spells and (if it’s a creature) all damage from instant and sorcery spells will be prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The player can put the cards in their graveyard in any order they choose.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The value of X is determined when the ability resolves. The value will not change over time.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This card has Protection from Black, from Blue, from Red, from White, and from Green. This is the definition of “All Colors”. This means it is possible to use an effect that removes one color of protection, such as just black, on this card.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This spell will not counter any creature spells on the stack. It only prevents new creature spells from being cast after it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'When you have seven or more cards in your graveyard, this card is black. It is not white and black.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can choose not to find the card.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'If the creature was only a creature as the result of an animation effect, its controller still gets to search for a card with the same name. For example, if an animated Still Life is put into a graveyard, its controller gets to search their library for a card named Still Life.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can choose to find fewer basic land cards if you want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can look in your library and then choose to find any number from zero to three creatures after you look at it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You decide on resolution whether or not to tap or untap the creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You flip a coin for each creature that attacks, not once per attack.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'This is a mana ability, which means it can be activated as part of the process of casting a spell or activating another ability. If that happens you get the mana right away, but you don’t get to look at the drawn card until you have finished casting that spell or activating that ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'You can only win a coin flip if you are the player flipping the coin. Your opponent losing a flip does not count as you winning one. This is a reversal of previous rulings.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-05-01', 'text': 'You choose the number as you cast the spell. If you choose 0, the creature’s controller will be dealt 5 damage. If you choose 5, that player will not be dealt any damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you are affected by Cursed Rack (an artifact that sets a player’s maximum hand size to four) and then put Thought Devourer onto the battlefield, your maximum hand size would be zero. However, if those permanents entered the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be four.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you are affected by Cursed Rack (an artifact that sets a player’s maximum hand size to four) and then put Thought Eater onto the battlefield, your maximum hand size would be one. However, if those permanents entered the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be four.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you are affected by Cursed Rack (an artifact that sets a player’s maximum hand size to four) and then put Thought Nibbler onto the battlefield, your maximum hand size would be two. However, if those permanents entered the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be four.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Overrun affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'While you’re searching the player’s library, you don’t have to find all the cards with the same name as an exiled card if you don’t want to. You can leave any number of them in that player’s library.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'You must be able to target a card in a graveyard to activate Crypt Creeper’s ability. It can’t target itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Battle of Wits has an “intervening ‘if’ clause.” This means that if you don’t have 200 or more cards in your library at the beginning of your upkeep, the ability won’t trigger. If the ability does trigger, but you have fewer than 200 cards in your library when the ability resolves, the ability will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'In tournaments, you must be able to shuffle your entire deck within a reasonable amount of time.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Only spells and abilities that target cards in graveyards will be affected. Abilities that don’t target cards in graveyards (like the one Tormod’s Crypt has) can still affect those cards.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The last ability only works when Ground Seal is on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you cast this as normal during your main phase, it will enter the battlefield and you’ll receive priority. If no abilities trigger because of this, you can activate its ability immediately, before any other player has a chance to remove it from the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'If you target yourself with this spell, you must reveal your entire hand to the other players just as any other player would.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "At the beginning of your upkeep, triggered abilities you control will resolve after triggered abilities your opponents control. If an opponent controls Braids and you control a triggered ability that puts a permanent onto the battlefield, you won\'t be able to sacrifice that permanent to satisfy Braids\'s ability."}]', "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If another creature with flying is dealt lethal damage at the same time as Soulcatcher, they’ll be destroyed at the same time. Soulcatcher’s ability won’t save it.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target when Second Thoughts tries to resolve, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'You can cast Innocent Blood even if some (or all) players control no creatures. Those players are simply unaffected.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You draw two cards and discard two cards all while Cephalid Broker’s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the target creature becomes an illegal target for Seize the Day, the spell doesn’t resolve. There isn’t an additional combat phase or main phase.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you somehow cast Seize the Day during an opponent’s main phase, that opponent attacks during the resulting combat phase, since it’s still that player’s turn. If you somehow cast it not during a main phase at all, all that happens is you untap the target creature.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Seize the Day can target a creature that’s already untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'A permanent gaining protection may cause a spell or ability on the stack to have an illegal target. As a spell or ability tries to resolve, if all its targets are illegal, that spell or ability doesn’t resolve. None of its effects happen, including effects unrelated to the target. If at least one target is still legal, the spell or ability does as much as it can to the remaining legal targets, and its other effects still happen.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Protection from a color means that the target creature can’t be blocked by creatures of that color, can’t be the target of spells of that color or abilities from sources of that color, can’t be enchanted or equipped by Auras or Equipment of that color, and all damage that sources of that color would deal to it is prevented. Nothing other than these events is prevented or illegal.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The legality of a spell’s targets is checked only as that spell begins to resolve. If Shelter gives the targeted creature protection from white, you’ll still draw a card.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You can’t choose “artifact” or “colorless” as Shelter asks you to choose a color, since those are not colors.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Because Ghastly Demise isn\'t put into your graveyard until it\'s finished resolving, it won\'t be counted when determining whether the creature is destroyed."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Ghastly Demise can target any nonblack creature. Compare the creature\'s toughness to the number of cards in your graveyard as Ghastly Demise resolves to see if that creature is destroyed."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Activating the ability creates a replacement effect that acts like a shield, replacing the next time Patchwork Gnomes would be destroyed that turn. This shield works against effects that try to destroy Patchwork Gnomes or lethal damage that would be dealt to Patchwork Gnomes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Patchwork Gnomes can regenerate even if it isn\'t in combat, it\'s already tapped, or it\'s undamaged."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You can activate the regeneration ability even if Patchwork Gnomes isn\'t at risk of being destroyed. Sometimes you need to discard cards. We understand."}]', "[{'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the cleanup step or an effect removes that damage, nonlethal damage dealt to Squirrel Mob may become lethal if the number of other Squirrels on the battlefield decreases.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Mystic Enforcer may become lethal if the number of cards in your graveyard falls below seven.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Mystic Zealot may become lethal if the number of cards in your graveyard falls below seven.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Squirrels may become lethal if the number of cards in your graveyard falls below seven.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Werebear may become lethal if the number of cards in your graveyard falls below seven.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to white creatures you control may become lethal if the number of cards in your graveyard falls below seven or if Divine Sacrament leaves the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Ember Beast can’t attack or block unless another creature is also assigned to attack or block at the same time. Notably, two Ember Beasts can attack or block together.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Once Ember Beast has been declared as an attacker or blocker, it doesn’t matter what happens to the other creature(s).'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Other creatures assigned to attack alongside Ember Beast don’t have to attack the same player or planeswalker. Other creatures assigned to block alongside Ember Beast don’t have to block the same creature as Ember Beast.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to look at the top card of your library any time or to play with the top card of your library revealed, and you activate Millikin’s mana ability while casting a spell, you can’t look at the new top card of your library until you are done casting the spell. The same is true if you activate Millikin’s ability while activating another ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'The ability that defines Terravore’s power and toughness works in all zones, not only the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'You must choose a legal target for each target required by Decimate. However, if a permanent has multiple card types, it may be chosen as the target for more than one instance of the word "target." For example, you could cast Decimate targeting an artifact creature, an enchantment, and a land.\'}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Laquatus\' Erfindungsreichtum", \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht so viele Karten, wie er auf seiner Hand hat, und wirft dann ebenso viele Karten ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Man weiß nie, wann die Inspiration einen überkommt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175796&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffcb715c-ef90-49ec-9702-1290895c8120\', \'multiverseId\': 175796}, \'multiverseid\': 175796}, {\'name\': \'Creatividad de Laquatus\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo roba un número de cartas igual al número de cartas en su mano, luego descarta ese mismo número de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Uno nunca sabe cuándo surgirá la inspiración.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'547063e3-b247-4e9d-857a-a40820cc8bf1\', \'multiverseId\': 177208}, \'multiverseid\': 177208}, {\'name\': \'Créativité selon Laquatus\', \'text\': "Le joueur ciblé pioche autant de cartes qu\'il en a en main, puis se défausse du même nombre de cartes.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Ça frémit, ça bouillonne, et nul ne sait quand une idée en sortira.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176148&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c277c69e-8e4e-4e0f-9a6d-ebf4df156e13\', \'multiverseId\': 176148}, \'multiverseid\': 176148}, {\'name\': \'Creatività di Laquatus\', \'text\': \'Il giocatore bersaglio pesca tante carte quante ne ha nella propria mano, poi ne scarta altrettante.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Non puoi mai sapere quando arriverà un\'ispirazione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'948a8aa1-a4f8-4ece-9853-d1589001d053\', \'multiverseId\': 176657}, \'multiverseid\': 176657}, {\'name\': \'ラクァタスの独創力\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0de30d4a-8c2c-466c-abaa-3c693e4e482c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Criatividade de Laquatus\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo compra um número de cards igual ao número de cards em sua própria mão e depois descarta aquele mesmo número de cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Nunca se sabe quando a inspiração irá emergir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3443d7d-8a8a-4798-8371-ad64cc5608dc\', \'multiverseId\': 178651}, \'multiverseid\': 178651}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aboshans Verlangen\', \'text\': \'Die verzauberte Kreatur hat Flugfähigkeit.\\nGrenzwert Die verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein. (Du hast den Grenzwert erreicht, solange sieben oder mehr Karten in deinem Friedhof sind.)\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175767&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f28eaad-8ff0-4ddf-96ab-f356b9d5a3e5\', \'multiverseId\': 175767}, \'multiverseid\': 175767}, {\'name\': \'Deseo de Áboshan\', \'text\': \'La criatura encantada tiene la habilidad de volar.\\nUmbral La criatura encantada no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades. (Tienes umbral mientras haya siete o más cartas en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Encantar criatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0843fd98-da5f-4fff-8268-945b4f574e81\', \'multiverseId\': 177179}, \'multiverseid\': 177179}, {\'name\': \'Désir selon Aboshân\', \'text\': "La créature enchantée a le vol.\\nSeuil — La créature enchantée ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités. (Vous avez le seuil tant qu\'il y a sept cartes ou plus dans votre cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Enchanter : créature\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176119&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5602a90-9125-4240-b676-817d76c31357\', \'multiverseId\': 176119}, \'multiverseid\': 176119}, {\'name\': \'Desiderio di Aboshan\', \'text\': \'La creatura incantata ha volare.\\nSoglia La creatura incantata non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità (hai soglia fintanto che ci sono almeno sette carte nel tuo cimitero).\', \'type\': \'Incanta Creatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f06e2a18-6391-45cf-8b69-b4c7a69ae5b0\', \'multiverseId\': 176628}, \'multiverseid\': 176628}, {\'name\': \'アボシャンの願望\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24183a46-1843-4cba-bdf1-6ee8111b14e2\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Desejo de Aboshan\', \'text\': \'A criatura encantada tem a habilidade de voar.\\nLimiar — A criatura encantada não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades. (Você atinge o limiar desde que haja sete ou mais cards em seu cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Encantar Criatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39938fa8-c8c9-40ae-8314-af57fdf47763\', \'multiverseId\': 178622}, \'multiverseid\': 178622}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abtrünniger Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDer Abtrünnige Engel wird beim Angreifen nicht getappt.\\nGrenzwert Der Abtrünnige Engel erhält +3/+3, ist schwarz, verursacht Trampelschaden und hat „Opfere zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Kreatur." (Du hast den Grenzwert erreicht, solange sieben oder mehr Karten in deinem Friedhof sind.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175765&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36237f86-48cf-4787-a3f8-232c6aceb859\', \'multiverseId\': 175765}, \'multiverseid\': 175765}, {\'name\': \'Ángel caprichoso\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEl Ángel caprichoso no se gira al atacar.\\nUmbral El Ángel caprichoso obtiene +3/+3, es negro, tiene la habilidad de arrollar y tiene: "Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, sacrifica una criatura". (Tienes umbral mientras haya siete o más cartas en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca1433a9-6d05-42a3-8ab3-e2db5de18922\', \'multiverseId\': 177177}, \'multiverseid\': 177177}, {\'name\': \'Ange rétive\', \'text\': "Vol\\nAttaquer avec l\'Ange rétive ne la fait pas s\'engager.\\nSeuil — l\'Ange rétive gagne +3/+3, est noire, a le piétinement, et a « Au début de votre entretien, sacrifiez une créature. » (Vous avez le seuil tant qu\'il y a sept cartes ou plus dans votre cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Créature : ange et horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176117&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0fe941e-c610-4fab-a4f8-648adff9f345\', \'multiverseId\': 176117}, \'multiverseid\': 176117}, {\'name\': \'Angelo Ribelle\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nL\\\'Angelo Ribelle attacca senza TAPpare.\\nSoglia - l\\\'Angelo Ribelle prende +3/+3, è nero, ha travolgere e ha "All\\\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, sacrifica una creatura" (hai soglia fintanto che ci sono almeno sette carte nel tuo cimitero).\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Angelico\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fe51971-472e-4d4a-81c1-256da614d1ba\', \'multiverseId\': 176626}, \'multiverseid\': 176626}, {\'name\': \'むら気な天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8114176-4750-4dfb-86d2-f061343a51ec\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Anjo Inconstante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAnjo Inconstante não é virado para atacar.\\nLimiar - Anjo Inconstante recebe +3/+3, é preto, tem a habilidade de atropelar e tem "No início de sua manutenção, sacrifique uma criatura." (Você atinge o limiar desde que haja sete ou mais cards em seu cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d01e8a5-e158-43dc-a081-b9e469c1171a\', \'multiverseId\': 178620}, \'multiverseid\': 178620}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akzeptable Verluste\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um Akzeptable Verluste zu spielen, eine zufällig bestimmte Karte aus deiner Hand ab.\\nAkzeptable Verluste fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175880&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6841aaff-5b7f-4949-b607-22dc1febf994\', \'multiverseId\': 175880}, \'multiverseid\': 175880}, {\'name\': \'Pérdidas aceptables\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para jugar las Pérdidas aceptables, descarta una carta al azar de tu mano.\\nLas Pérdidas aceptables hacen 5 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41f77d79-5d50-4b77-a738-87f0e93bfcc7\', \'multiverseId\': 177292}, \'multiverseid\': 177292}, {\'name\': \'Pertes acceptables\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour jouer ces Pertes acceptables, défaussez-vous au hasard d\'une carte de votre main.\\nCes Pertes acceptables infligent 5 blessures à la créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176232&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e59ba75-4219-4102-80a0-be29249eae9b\', \'multiverseId\': 176232}, \'multiverseid\': 176232}, {\'name\': \'Perdite Accettabili\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per giocare le Perdite Accettabili, scarta una carta a caso dalla tua mano.\\nLe Perdite Accettabili infliggono 5 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2554a96-2470-4c0a-ad97-5fa9d0d69465\', \'multiverseId\': 176741}, \'multiverseid\': 176741}, {\'name\': \'容認される損失\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c9edf91-6b99-4b33-a9db-568ec300ec44\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Perdas Reparáveis\', \'text\': \'Como um custo adicional para jogar Perdas Reparáveis, descarte um card aleatoriamente de sua mão.\\nPerdas Reparáveis causa 5 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52d71ed5-6072-4cd2-9597-1da394a77c9a\', \'multiverseId\': 178735}, \'multiverseid\': 178735}]', '[{\'name\': \'Allumfassende Theorie\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen Zauberspruch spielt, kann dieser Spieler {2} bezahlen. Falls er dies tut, zieht er eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Gekritzel eines Wahnsinnigen und Formeln eines Genies sind oft kaum unterscheidbar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175820&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'006fd2b8-9af2-4871-b309-76d66454737a\', \'multiverseId\': 175820}, \'multiverseid\': 175820}, {\'name\': \'Teoría unificadora\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador juegue un hechizo, ese jugador puede pagar {2}. Si lo hace, ese jugador roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Los garabatos de un lunático y las fórmulas de un genio frecuentemente son indistinguibles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ddc3be9-c489-4106-ab19-33008917fd40\', \'multiverseId\': 177232}, \'multiverseid\': 177232}, {\'name\': \'Théorie unifiée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur joue un sort, ce joueur peut payer {2}. Si ce joueur fait ainsi, il pioche une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Les gribouillis d\'un dément et les formules d\'un génie sont difficiles à distinguer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176172&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b123b681-a8b6-48ec-8f5f-77f8d659c3b2\', \'multiverseId\': 176172}, \'multiverseid\': 176172}, {\'name\': \'Teoria Unificata\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore gioca una magia, quel giocatore può spendere {2}. Se lo fa, quel giocatore pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli scarabocchi di un folle e le formule di un genio sono spesso indistinguibili.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e1a4102-861b-4380-8c72-805e6f7c90d9\', \'multiverseId\': 176681}, \'multiverseid\': 176681}, {\'name\': \'統一理論\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8e01ad6-1a67-4961-ace5-74e0e5c746ba\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Teoria Unificadora\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador joga uma mágica, aquele jogador pode pagar {2}. Se ele o fizer, ele compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Rabiscos de um lunático e fórmulas de um gênio costumam ser indistinguíveis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d31196b2-2c97-4fb5-9210-49c0e7a9fdf6\', \'multiverseId\': 178675}, \'multiverseid\': 178675}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amugaba\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{2}{U}, wirf eine Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Bringe Amugaba auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Illusion\', \'flavor\': \'Die Avior behaupten, dass es sich von Gewittern und Regenbogen ernährt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175769&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6792ae19-004a-430c-bc8d-6eb2f2a3fd7b\', \'multiverseId\': 175769}, \'multiverseid\': 175769}, {\'name\': \'Amugaba\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{2}{U}, descartar una carta de tu mano: Regresa el Amugaba a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusión\', \'flavor\': \'Los aven aseguran que se alimenta de truenos y arco iris.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be9072a4-1d43-4f7d-9172-1695473cc2b1\', \'multiverseId\': 177181}, \'multiverseid\': 177181}, {\'name\': \'Amugaba\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{2}{U}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte de votre main : Renvoyez l\'Amugaba dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : illusion\', \'flavor\': "Les avemains affirment qu\'il se nourrit du tonnerre et des arcs-en-ciel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176121&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e7257c5-3b22-4719-9285-35477f226fed\', \'multiverseId\': 176121}, \'multiverseid\': 176121}, {\'name\': \'Amugaba\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{2}{U}, Scarta una carta dalla tua mano: Il proprietario riprende in mano Amugaba.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Illusione\', \'flavor\': \'Gli aviani narrano che si nutra di tuoni e arcobaleni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a6add32-4ae1-43ef-a2ae-dffaac1e759d\', \'multiverseId\': 176630}, \'multiverseid\': 176630}, {\'name\': \'アムガバ\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2c697b0-4d88-45f9-9c53-77155313f698\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Amugaba\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{2}{U}, Descarte um card de sua mão: Devolve Amugaba para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusão\', \'flavor\': \'Os avianos dizem que ele se alimenta de trovões e arco-íris.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd6f059b-0d85-488e-a45e-5cb1c14709d9\', \'multiverseId\': 178624}, \'multiverseid\': 178624}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anarchist\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Anarchist ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Stadtbewohner\', \'flavor\': \'Die, die nicht folgen wollen, sind zum Anführen verdammt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175881&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'516b2ecf-5695-425b-ab29-e9b7f1cdb2fe\', \'multiverseId\': 175881}, \'multiverseid\': 175881}, {\'name\': \'Anarquista\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Anarquista entre en juego, puedes regresar la carta objetivo de conjuro de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ciudadano\', \'flavor\': \'Aquéllos que no siguen están destinados a guiar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad2bae8d-045b-4c16-add9-4e46b95a7d94\', \'multiverseId\': 177293}, \'multiverseid\': 177293}, {\'name\': \'Anarchiste\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Anarchiste arrive en jeu, vous pouvez renvoyer la carte de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : citadin\', \'flavor\': \'Ceux qui ne suivront pas seront condamnés à commander.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176233&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a3242d1-ec2c-4b6e-888c-3e90a7121ad9\', \'multiverseId\': 176233}, \'multiverseid\': 176233}, {\'name\': \'Anarchico\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Anarchico entra in gioco, puoi riprendere in mano una carta stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cittadino\', \'flavor\': \'Coloro che non vogliono seguire sono condannati a comandare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'653ba9ed-8fd8-438a-8809-0337e41c39c5\', \'multiverseId\': 176742}, \'multiverseid\': 176742}, {\'name\': \'無政府主義者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e61c51c5-9568-46b2-a652-aacad9dccb80\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Anarquista\', \'text\': \'Quando Anarquista entra em jogo, você pode devolver o card de feitiço alvo de seu cemitério para a sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Citadino\', \'flavor\': \'Aqueles que não seguem estão fadados a comandar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46001d17-11a8-485f-9493-fea2fcc4a4bd\', \'multiverseId\': 178736}, \'multiverseid\': 178736}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angesicht des Schreckens\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, wirf eine Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Das Angesicht des Schreckens kann in diesem Zug nur von schwarzen und/oder Artefaktkreaturen geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'„Es hat nur fünf Leute zu Tode erschreckt. Daran muss ich noch arbeiten." —Braids, Wahnwitz-Beschwörerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175842&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a301eaf-6869-4600-8dee-20013a57b4e7\', \'multiverseId\': 175842}, \'multiverseid\': 175842}, {\'name\': \'Rostro del miedo\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, descartar una carta de tu mano: El Rostro del miedo no puede ser bloqueado este turno excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas negras.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror\', \'flavor\': \'"Sólo ha matado del susto a cinco personas. No es mi mejor obra." —Trenzas, invocadora de demencia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93365185-1890-41e1-ba41-ac207c4a6102\', \'multiverseId\': 177254}, \'multiverseid\': 177254}, {\'name\': \'Visage de la peur\', \'text\': "{2}{B}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte de votre main : Le Visage de la peur ne peut pas être bloqué ce tour-ci excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures noires.", \'type\': \'Créature : horreur\', \'flavor\': "« Cinq seulement sont morts de peur. J\'ai fait mieux, autrefois. » —Nattes, invocatrice de démences.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176194&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e00dc75b-22c9-45f6-88a0-f20240d00a31\', \'multiverseId\': 176194}, \'multiverseid\': 176194}, {\'name\': \'Volto della Paura\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, Scarta una carta dalla tua mano: Il Volto della Paura non può essere bloccato in questo turno tranne che da creature artefatto e/o da creature nere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore\', \'flavor\': \'"Ha fatto morire di terrore solo cinque persone. Non è stato il mio lavoro migliore". —-Braids, evocatore di dementia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e567960-a2d7-4b11-a254-beb7ede0ec13\', \'multiverseId\': 176703}, \'multiverseid\': 176703}, {\'name\': \'恐怖面\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e650b160-5632-44eb-a222-46f1cbd52cf7\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Face do Medo\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, Descarte um card de sua mão: Face do Medo só pode ser bloqueado por criaturas pretas e/ou por criaturas artefato neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror\', \'flavor\': \'"Ele matou apenas cinco pessoas de susto. Não é o meu melhor trabalho." —Braids, invocadora da demência\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6043dbf1-e7b3-4a4b-af06-574963761431\', \'multiverseId\': 178697}, \'multiverseid\': 178697}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anmutige Antilope\', \'text\': \'Ebenentarnung\\nImmer wenn die Anmutige Antilope einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du ein Land deiner Wahl zu einer Ebene werden lassen, bis die Anmutige Antilope das Spiel verlässt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Antilope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175732&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f8b687e-89ba-4504-aab2-55c653f58b7f\', \'multiverseId\': 175732}, \'multiverseid\': 175732}, {\'name\': \'Antílope grácil\', \'text\': \'Cruza llanuras.\\nSiempre que el Antílope grácil haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes elegir que la tierra objetivo sea una llanura hasta que el Antílope grácil salga del juego.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Antílope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3357a7be-5e5b-4ca8-8335-1cc35d8c5898\', \'multiverseId\': 177144}, \'multiverseid\': 177144}, {\'name\': \'Antilope gracieuse\', \'text\': "Traversée des plaines\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Antilope gracieuse inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez faire que le terrain ciblé devienne une plaine jusqu\'à ce que l\'Antilope gracieuse quitte le jeu.", \'type\': \'Créature : antilope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176084&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deba7e0f-fa70-4e79-80af-a276bf366927\', \'multiverseId\': 176084}, \'multiverseid\': 176084}, {\'name\': \'Antilope Leggiadra\', \'text\': "Passa-pianure\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Antilope Leggiadra infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi trasformare una terra bersaglio in una pianura fino a quando l\'Antilope Leggiadra lascia il gioco.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Antilope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e25ab412-d9a4-4aeb-9e4e-c3ec485b4f82\', \'multiverseId\': 176593}, \'multiverseid\': 176593}, {\'name\': \'優雅なアンテロープ\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eaeec25-7b68-4ccb-a8a8-3d8cfa0390e2\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Antílope Elegante\', \'text\': \'Travessia de planície\\nToda vez que Antílope Elegante causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode optar por transformar o terreno alvo em uma planície até que Antílope Elegante saia de jogo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Antílope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4350294-9062-4057-9353-b353093a20e9\', \'multiverseId\': 178587}, \'multiverseid\': 178587}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anzeichen wachsenden Wahnsinns\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zeigt die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor. Dieser Spieler wirft dann alle Karten, die keine Länder sind und die den selben Namen wie eine andere Karte auf seiner Hand haben, ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Übung macht den Meister, aber Besessenheit macht noch besser."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175851&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cad03fed-d582-4dd6-9109-aa7220599ed2\', \'multiverseId\': 175851}, \'multiverseid\': 175851}, {\'name\': \'Indicio de locura\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo muestra su mano. Ese jugador descarta de ahí todas las cartas que no sean tierra que tengan el mismo nombre que otra carta en su mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"La práctica hace al maestro, pero la obsesión da mejores resultados."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'218513b0-4c35-41e1-82ab-b2374ba95aaf\', \'multiverseId\': 177263}, \'multiverseid\': 177263}, {\'name\': \'Soupçon de démence\', \'text\': "Le joueur ciblé révèle sa main. Ce joueur se défausse de toutes les cartes non-terrain de sa main qui ont le même nom qu\'une autre carte de sa main.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« La pratique aide à la perfection, mais l\'obsession est meilleure encore. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176203&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28a8b774-0a80-4902-b75a-ef745f3dae51\', \'multiverseId\': 176203}, \'multiverseid\': 176203}, {\'name\': \'Traccia di Pazzia\', \'text\': "Il giocatore bersaglio rivela la propria mano. Quel giocatore scarta da essa tutte le carte non terra con lo stesso nome di un\'altra carta presente nella propria mano.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La pratica rende perfetti, ma l\\\'ossessione è anche meglio".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b8432e0-e189-4363-bdbb-958201877b6d\', \'multiverseId\': 176712}, \'multiverseid\': 176712}, {\'name\': \'狂気の暗示\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55035e21-da8a-443b-a766-9b5ea1a5fefa\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Indicação de Insanidade\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo revela sua própria mão. Aquele jogador descarta de sua mão todos os cards que não sejam terrenos, com o mesmo nome de um outro card de sua própria mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"A prática faz a perfeição, mas a obsessão faz ainda melhor."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a002b144-38da-4a8e-be03-ffbe3c8c5c6f\', \'multiverseId\': 178706}, \'multiverseid\': 178706}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aschfahle Feuerbestie\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: Die Aschfahle Feuerbestie fügt allen nichtfliegenden Kreaturen 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bin mir nicht sicher, was mich mehr beeindruckt: ihre Gründlichkeit oder ihre Intensität." —Matoc, Magmamagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175882&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6609262e-289c-43b2-9404-93139772177d\', \'multiverseId\': 175882}, \'multiverseid\': 175882}, {\'name\': \'Bestia de fuego cenicienta\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: La Bestia de fuego cenicienta hace 1 punto de daño a cada criatura que no tenga la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"No sé con seguridad qué me impresiona más, su minuciosidad o su intensidad." —Mátoc, lavamante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a4b3943-13ba-4b4c-b3f8-fe2181e42731\', \'multiverseId\': 177294}, \'multiverseid\': 177294}, {\'name\': \'Bêtefeu cendreuse\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: La Bêtefeu cendreuse inflige 1 blessure à chaque créature sans le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne sais pas ce qui m\'impressionne le plus : sa minutie ou sa férocité. » —Matoc, lavamancien.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176234&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe98f556-88c6-4fa2-b4ac-5e4979503085\', \'multiverseId\': 176234}, \'multiverseid\': 176234}, {\'name\': \'Pirobestia Cinerea\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: La Pirobestia Cinerea infligge 1 danno a ogni creatura senza volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Non sono sicuro di cosa mi abbia più colpito: la sua determinazione o la sua efficacia". —Matoc, lavamante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab1db575-12a8-47e2-8739-b7eef610dcd6\', \'multiverseId\': 176743}, \'multiverseid\': 176743}, {\'name\': \'灰燼の火獣\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ec99df8-cb09-473a-b606-4ffda3a39554\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Besta Ígnea Cinérea\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: Besta Ígnea Cinérea causa 1 ponto de dano a cada criatura sem a habilidade de voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu não tenho certeza do que me impressiona mais, sua eficácia ou sua intensidade." —Matoc, lavamante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2999e662-a45d-43f3-b857-686a90719d12\', \'multiverseId\': 178737}, \'multiverseid\': 178737}]', '[{\'name\': \'Atogatog\', \'text\': \'Opfere einen Atog: Der Atogatog erhält +X/+X bis zum Ende des Zuges, wobei X die Stärke des geopferten Atogs ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Atog, Legende\', \'flavor\': \'Er liebt altmodische Familienessen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175994&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fd719e4-3a81-46a5-946d-f2acd9ff3f7e\', \'multiverseId\': 175994}, \'multiverseid\': 175994}, {\'name\': \'Atogatog\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar un Atog: El Atogatog obtiene +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la fuerza del Atog sacrificado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Atog legendario\', \'flavor\': \'Se deleita con las comidas familiares tradicionales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d33bedd-ef91-45fa-ae86-9419f7febf5a\', \'multiverseId\': 177406}, \'multiverseid\': 177406}, {\'name\': \'Atogatog\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez un atog : L\'Atogatog gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, où X est égal à la force de l\'atog sacrifié.", \'type\': \'Créature : atog et légende\', \'flavor\': \'Il adore les repas de famille.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176346&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82f390f7-a521-414f-8461-884a722169e5\', \'multiverseId\': 176346}, \'multiverseid\': 176346}, {\'name\': \'Atogatog\', \'text\': "Sacrifica un Atog: L\'Atogatog prende +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è pari alla forza dell\'Atog sacrificato.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Leggenda Atog\', \'flavor\': \'Ama i tradizionali pranzi di famiglia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1afa1a91-7165-4e6c-9dc6-71ce55572b33\', \'multiverseId\': 176855}, \'multiverseid\': 176855}, {\'name\': \'アトガトグ\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3c80ea5-83cd-41db-8ed1-dde87c9381e6\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Atogatogue\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique um Atogue: Atogatogue recebe +X/+X até o final do turno, onde X é igual ao poder do Atogue sacrificado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Atogue Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'Ele aprecia as antiquadas refeições em família.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'895d0eb7-a6c6-49d5-9bf0-1af40e53b244\', \'multiverseId\': 178849}, \'multiverseid\': 178849}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufgegebener Außenposten\', \'text\': \'Der Aufgegebene Außenposten kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W}.\\n{T}, opfere den Aufgegebenen Außenposten: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176020&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'260e6743-b7d8-4253-9833-c3058549ea3b\', \'multiverseId\': 176020}, \'multiverseid\': 176020}, {\'name\': \'Puesto de avanzada abandonado\', \'text\': \'El Puesto de avanzada abandonado entra en juego girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{T}, sacrificar el Puesto de avanzada abandonado: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb4a738b-fc58-4e63-9ca2-c6ef61fc2ad7\', \'multiverseId\': 177432}, \'multiverseid\': 177432}, {\'name\': \'Avant-poste abandonné\', \'text\': "L\'Avant-poste abandonné arrive en jeu engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} à votre réserve.\\n{T}, sacrifiez l\'Avant-poste abandonné: Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176372&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be99506b-9481-4599-89eb-4863570018f8\', \'multiverseId\': 176372}, \'multiverseid\': 176372}, {\'name\': \'Avamposto Abbandonato\', \'text\': "L\'Avamposto Abbandonato entra in gioco TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{T}, Sacrifica l\'Avamposto Abbandonato: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'961a5223-1c56-4c3c-82e8-d2b49d945007\', \'multiverseId\': 176881}, \'multiverseid\': 176881}, {\'name\': \'見捨てられた前哨地\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'811b7911-2ee4-41e5-9251-9438430261bd\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Posto Avançado Abandonado\', \'text\': \'Posto Avançado Abandonado entra em jogo virado.\\n{T}: Adiciona {W} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{T}, Sacrifique Posto Avançado Abandonado: Adiciona uma mana de qualquer cor a sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ac9fcba-0e61-4cdc-893c-3a63f324b1f6\', \'multiverseId\': 178875}, \'multiverseid\': 178875}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufopferungsvoller Hüter\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges Schutz vor Spontanzaubern und vor Hexereien.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Ihre Augen strahlen mit der Stärke von zwanzig Schilden. Jeder Blick ist eine Erlösung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175726&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9e07f13-7f35-4d42-bb45-f7557b4c7753\', \'multiverseId\': 175726}, \'multiverseid\': 175726}, {\'name\': \'Vigilante devota\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: El permanente objetivo que controles gana protección contra hechizos de instantáneo y de conjuro hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Sus ojos resplandecen con la fuerza de veinte escudos. Cada mirada es una salvación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa6e1749-73b6-4e28-bc56-f1d4abf682f1\', \'multiverseId\': 177138}, \'multiverseid\': 177138}, {\'name\': \'Assistante dévouée\', \'text\': "{W}, {T}: Le permanent ciblé que vous contrôlez acquiert la protection contre les sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : clerc\', \'flavor\': \'Ses yeux brillent comme le reflet de vingt boucliers. Chacun de ses regards sauve une âme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176078&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb36c295-0126-469d-b1e8-198e78f6271d\', \'multiverseId\': 176078}, \'multiverseid\': 176078}, {\'name\': \'Custode Devota\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Il permanente bersaglio che controlli guadagna protezione dalle magie istantaneo e dalle magie stregoneria fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico\', \'flavor\': \'I suoi occhi brillano con la forza di venti scudi. Ogni sguardo è la salvezza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfce9372-5ab9-4655-aacd-e1ad2394fd19\', \'multiverseId\': 176587}, \'multiverseid\': 176587}, {\'name\': \'献身的な世話人\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc4e7caf-0e3f-4faa-bca8-2eeb433fb79d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Vigia Devotado\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: A permanente alvo que você controla ganha proteção contra mágicas instantâneas e contra feitiços até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Seus olhos brilham com a intensidade de vinte escudos. Cada relance é uma salvação.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7629727-d84d-45e6-a436-ad57d2f39b63\', \'multiverseId\': 178581}, \'multiverseid\': 178581}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auraschöpfer\', \'text\': \'Du kannst eine Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen, wenn der Auraschöpfer ins Spiel kommt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Schönheit berührt die Erinnerung wie ein Duft, der die Luft durchtränkt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175713&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23bb2bef-a668-4fda-a47f-bd80d8c7df6c\', \'multiverseId\': 175713}, \'multiverseid\': 175713}, {\'name\': \'Auramante\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Auramante entre en juego, puedes regresar la carta objetivo de encantamiento de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero\', \'flavor\': \'La belleza agita el recuerdo como un perfume dulce estimula el aire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'159f6762-d6c9-4155-bae4-1c5ae1a767cd\', \'multiverseId\': 177125}, \'multiverseid\': 177125}, {\'name\': \'Auramancienne\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Auramancienne arrive en jeu, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte d\'enchantement ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Comme un doux parfum se répand dans l\'air, la beauté réveille la mémoire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176065&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9755242b-a9f2-4b03-95de-39b5204a040f\', \'multiverseId\': 176065}, \'multiverseid\': 176065}, {\'name\': \'Animago\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Animago entra in gioco, puoi riprendere in mano una carta incantesimo bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago\', \'flavor\': "La bellezza risveglia la memoria così come un profumo soave rende l\'aria frizzante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'248e6f9d-6c45-47e3-8517-5fcfa0574ef2\', \'multiverseId\': 176574}, \'multiverseid\': 176574}, {\'name\': \'オーラ術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ed5e08c-110e-468d-9c0e-4bc9c309e693\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Auramante\', \'text\': \'Quando Auramante entra em jogo, você pode devolver o card de encantamento alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mago\', \'flavor\': \'A beleza estimula a mente como um perfume doce agita o ar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed07cabd-ead9-4493-80a9-253efb3ecdc2\', \'multiverseId\': 178568}, \'multiverseid\': 178568}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aurenübertragung\', \'text\': \'Verschiebe eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die eine bleibende Karte verzaubert, auf eine andere bleibende Karte, die sie verzaubern kann. Übernimm die Kontrolle über diese Verzauberung. (Dieser Effekt endet nicht am Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Das ist nicht wirklich Stehlen. Es ist eher erweitertes Ausleihen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175770&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88587c11-d58b-42d5-8588-28ada3f690d9\', \'multiverseId\': 175770}, \'multiverseid\': 175770}, {\'name\': \'Robo de aura\', \'text\': \'Quita el encantamiento objetivo que esté encantando a un permanente y ponlo sobre otro permanente al que pueda encantar. Gana el control de ese encantamiento. (Este efecto no termina al final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"No es robar realmente. Es como tomar prestado por mucho tiempo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d3cea3b-d3b2-463b-a3f3-89d044784a5f\', \'multiverseId\': 177182}, \'multiverseid\': 177182}, {\'name\': "Greffe d\'aura", \'text\': "Déplacez l\'enchantement ciblé qui enchante un permanent sur un autre permanent qu\'il peut enchanter. Acquérez le contrôle de cet enchantement. (Cet effet ne s\'arrête pas à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ce n\'est pas du vol, c\'est juste un emprunt de très longue durée. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176122&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ead1382-b1a0-4910-84ce-0c22d70b0bd7\', \'multiverseId\': 176122}, \'multiverseid\': 176122}, {\'name\': "Innesto dell\'Aura", \'text\': "Sposta un incantesimo bersaglio che sta incantando un permanente su un altro permanente che può incantare. Prendi il controllo di quell\'incantesimo (Questo effetto non termina alla fine del turno.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non è proprio un furto. Diciamo che la prendo in prestito a tempo indeterminato".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b6c01b5-de30-444a-bfa6-b393b421a7d2\', \'multiverseId\': 176631}, \'multiverseid\': 176631}, {\'name\': \'オーラの移植\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddfbad79-34a1-4814-a93f-c08e7b214f8b\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Enxerto de Aura\', \'text\': \'Mova o encantamento alvo que está encantando uma permanente para outra permanente que ele possa encantar. Ganhe o controle daquele encantamento. (Este efeito não cessa no final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Não é exatamente um roubo. É mais como um empréstimo a longo prazo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9d9a107-81ad-4279-97bd-8bc2c0913afd\', \'multiverseId\': 178625}, \'multiverseid\': 178625}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgehungerter Ghul\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, opfere den Ausgehungerten Ghul: Entferne bis zu zwei Karten deiner Wahl aus genau einem Friedhof ganz aus dem Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Erinnerungen schmecken unterschiedlich. Die Ghule bevorzugen die krankhafte Süße von verlorener Liebe und den verräucherten Geschmack von grausamem Mord.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175843&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb2216d1-6b2b-4272-a556-98b41c82bdfc\', \'multiverseId\': 175843}, \'multiverseid\': 175843}, {\'name\': \'Necrófago famélico\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, sacrificar el Necrófago famélico: Remueve del juego hasta dos cartas objetivo de un solo cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Los recuerdos tienen sabores distinguibles. Sus favoritos son la enfermiza dulzura del amor perdido y la amarga fumosidad del homicidio cruel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'340f4aa8-f8b5-4f3f-a7c5-fe6b87675e02\', \'multiverseId\': 177255}, \'multiverseid\': 177255}, {\'name\': \'Goule affamée\', \'text\': "{1}{B}, sacrifiez la Goule affamée : Retirez de la partie jusqu\'à deux cartes ciblées d\'un cimetière unique.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Chaque souvenir a un goût différent. Ses préférés sont la douceur maladive d\'un amour perdu ou l\'âcreté d\'un meurtre cruel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176195&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c04f40a4-c44e-46c1-a7b1-788ebec22241\', \'multiverseId\': 176195}, \'multiverseid\': 176195}, {\'name\': \'Ghoul Affamato\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, Sacrifica il Ghoul Affamato: Rimuovi dal gioco fino a due carte bersaglio presenti in un singolo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': "Le memorie hanno un gusto diverso. I suoi favoriti sono la nauseante dolcezza dell\'amore perduto e la fumosa amarezza degli efferati omicidi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f4fba20-d3af-473c-ac16-a7c528b351a9\', \'multiverseId\': 176704}, \'multiverseid\': 176704}, {\'name\': \'飢えたる食屍鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaad3d25-d902-48a8-95c2-e516b996e7e6\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Carniçal Esfomeado\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, Sacrifique Carniçal Esfomeado: Remove de jogo até dois cards alvo de um único cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'As lembranças têm sabores diferentes. Seus favoritos são a doçura enjoativa do amor perdido e o gosto amargo de fumaça do assassinato cruel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a3c9c91-92f2-48a3-897f-1ef2ea145082\', \'multiverseId\': 178698}, \'multiverseid\': 178698}]', "[{'name': 'Ausschweifende Erkundung', 'text': 'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einem Standardland und bringe diese Karte getappt ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\\nRückblende {4}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten spielen. Entferne sie dann ganz aus dem Spiel.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175944&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd4e92e9-2283-449c-87d3-0d52f5608622', 'multiverseId': 175944}, 'multiverseid': 175944}, {'name': 'Reconocimiento profundo', 'text': 'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica y pon esa carta en juego girada. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\\nRetrospectiva {4}{G}. (Puedes jugar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego remuévela del juego.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177356&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '304c226d-613d-4bba-9d16-a047d310d7a6', 'multiverseId': 177356}, 'multiverseid': 177356}, {'name': 'Reconnaissance en profondeur', 'text': 'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base et mettez cette carte en jeu engagée. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nFlashback {4}{G} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Retirez-la ensuite de la partie.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176296&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a64a56b-7238-4c02-bb21-ba79ae48611f', 'multiverseId': 176296}, 'multiverseid': 176296}, {'name': 'Perlustrazione Approfondita', 'text': 'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta terra base e mettila in gioco TAPpata. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\\nFlashback {4}{G} (puoi giocare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi rimuovila dal gioco).', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176805&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9078aaf-6352-4c17-91ae-06a7255f22ed', 'multiverseId': 176805}, 'multiverseid': 176805}, {'name': '綿密な偵察', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e9b273b1-5403-41bb-a9bd-92f90845549a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Verificação Profunda', 'text': 'Procure em seu grimório por um card de terreno básico e coloque-o em jogo virado. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\\nRecapitular {4}{G} (Você pode jogar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitulação. Depois remova-o do jogo.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178799&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6bb5654-c9b8-49b8-965b-0c046be647db', 'multiverseId': 178799}, 'multiverseid': 178799}]", '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Bogenschütze\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Der Avior-Bogenschütze fügt einer angreifenden oder blockenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Mit Adleraugen gezielt, treffen ihre Pfeile immer ins Schwarze.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175714&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bc2238b-01ab-41bb-ab52-bea23d10775f\', \'multiverseId\': 175714}, \'multiverseid\': 175714}, {\'name\': \'Arquero aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{2}{W}, {T}: El Arquero aven hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo atacante o bloqueadora.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'Apuntan con ojos de águila, por eso sus flechas nunca fallan el blanco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'261a836a-d581-4340-b3f7-4ce400c603ec\', \'multiverseId\': 177126}, \'multiverseid\': 177126}, {\'name\': \'Archer avemain\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{2}{W}, {T}: L\'Archer avemain inflige 2 blessures à la créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Leurs yeux d\'aigle guident leurs mains, leurs flèches ne ratent jamais la cible.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176066&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f2f8dc9-03d7-410f-97cf-1d5a6ab733ac\', \'multiverseId\': 176066}, \'multiverseid\': 176066}, {\'name\': \'Arciere Aviano\', \'text\': "Volare\\n{2}{W}, {T}: L\'Arciere Aviano infligge 2 danni a una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Guidate dagli occhi delle aquile, le loro frecce non mancano mai il bersaglio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63318526-6d67-47e6-9304-cc503391bb8a\', \'multiverseId\': 176575}, \'multiverseid\': 176575}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの射手\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'778caddd-9417-4580-b18b-a7e77b6cf89a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Arqueiro Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Arqueiro Aviano causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura alvo atacante ou bloqueadora.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': \'Miradas por olhos de águia, suas flechas nunca deixar de acertar o alvo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'673c6bae-1f11-4d80-9d46-9fa752511d7e\', \'multiverseId\': 178569}, \'multiverseid\': 178569}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Fischer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Avior-Fischer aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Mit denselben Speeren, mit denen sie heute ihr Essen aufspießen, werden sie morgen ihre Häuser verteidigen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175771&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c0dee07-65dd-4bc6-a3f5-096a2a7f4d93\', \'multiverseId\': 175771}, \'multiverseid\': 175771}, {\'name\': \'Pescador aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Pescador aven vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'Las mismas lanzas que usan los aven para atrapar su comida hoy, defenderán sus hogares mañana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbebf706-6139-4f70-8286-e0be40eb8609\', \'multiverseId\': 177183}, \'multiverseid\': 177183}, {\'name\': \'Pêcheur avemain\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand le Pêcheur avemain est mis dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, vous pouvez piocher une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Ils défendront demain leur maison avec cette même lance qui leur sert aujourd\'hui à attraper leur nourriture.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176123&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2126af9-9e45-4d70-a32d-e37cd1a49ba2\', \'multiverseId\': 176123}, \'multiverseid\': 176123}, {\'name\': \'Pescatore Aviano\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Pescatore Aviano viene messo in un cimitero dal gioco, puoi pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Le stesse lance che catturano oggi il loro cibo difenderanno un domani le loro case.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'065a2977-d92f-47af-88c5-2edf97964c77\', \'multiverseId\': 176632}, \'multiverseid\': 176632}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの魚捕り\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5aa0c28-e4ff-4d42-b8be-afae7e41ccaf\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Pescador Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Pescador Aviano é colocado num cemitério vindo de jogo, você pode comprar um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': \'As mesmas lanças que caçam sua comida hoje irão defender suas casas amanhã.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1ff9444-72f0-49ad-aa1b-c64c3e101595\', \'multiverseId\': 178626}, \'multiverseid\': 178626}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Lüfteleser\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{1}{U}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zeigt die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek offen vor.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Selbst die kleinste Welle erzählt eine lange Geschichte."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175773&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a91009ba-e1d8-4da2-b481-05c85b837bd0\', \'multiverseId\': 175773}, \'multiverseid\': 175773}, {\'name\': \'Leevientos aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{1}{U}: El jugador objetivo muestra la carta de la parte superior de su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'"La ola más pequeña cuenta una historia de una profundidad de 10 brazas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e094d7a-0a15-4099-8781-6c87d518f282\', \'multiverseId\': 177185}, \'multiverseid\': 177185}, {\'name\': \'Avemain déchiffre-vent\', \'text\': \'Vol\\n{1}{U}: Le joueur ciblé révèle la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« La plus petite des vaguelettes conte des histoires profondes de dix brasses. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176125&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdae6831-0dea-4cb9-92ab-23337ca4604f\', \'multiverseId\': 176125}, \'multiverseid\': 176125}, {\'name\': \'Scrutavento Aviano\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{1}{U}: Il giocatore bersaglio rivela la prima carta del proprio grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"La più piccola increspatura racconta una storia che si è svolta a dieci leghe di profondità."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6670326a-3eb1-4f46-9c31-d02cfcf302dc\', \'multiverseId\': 176634}, \'multiverseid\': 176634}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの風読み\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85a28c1e-e567-4186-a926-473714227a45\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Leitor dos Ventos Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{1}{U}: O jogador alvo revela o card do topo de seu próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mago Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': \'"A menor ondulação na superfície conta uma história com dez braças de profundidade."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81973233-5561-4607-8a86-57e5b69ac250\', \'multiverseId\': 178628}, \'multiverseid\': 178628}]', "[{'name': 'Avior-Rauchflechter', 'text': 'Fliegend, Schutz vor Rot', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat', 'flavor': 'In einer Welt, die sich noch von Bränden erholt, werden einige schon vernarbt geboren.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175772&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9bdd6e26-2584-481d-9739-1adc690d4d80', 'multiverseId': 175772}, 'multiverseid': 175772}, {'name': 'Tejehumo aven', 'text': 'Vuela, protección contra rojo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado ave', 'flavor': 'En un mundo aún atormentado por las quemaduras, algunos ya nacen con cicatrices.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177184&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7a932e5-517e-4b79-9c7f-f2f4df16dc7f', 'multiverseId': 177184}, 'multiverseid': 177184}, {'name': 'Avemain tisse-fumée', 'text': 'Vol, protection contre le rouge', 'type': 'Créature : oiseau et soldat', 'flavor': 'Dans un monde de décombres fumants, certains naissent déjà brûlés.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176124&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a30c37c-799e-4bb8-9528-e9dc3ef742ea', 'multiverseId': 176124}, 'multiverseid': 176124}, {'name': 'Tessifumo Aviano', 'text': 'Volare, protezione dal rosso', 'type': 'Creatura — Soldato Uccello', 'flavor': 'In un mondo ancora segnato dalle bruciature, alcuni nascono già scottati.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176633&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b519a42f-6916-4a85-826a-b8f3869c80ca', 'multiverseId': 176633}, 'multiverseid': 176633}, {'name': 'エイヴンの煙の紡ぎ手', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1af8ebaf-8a43-477d-b416-5fdc90ad8ea8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Tecelão de Fumaça Aviano', 'text': 'Voar, proteção contra o vermelho', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro', 'flavor': 'Em um mundo ainda ferido por queimaduras, alguns já nascem com cicatrizes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178627&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '123fcfb2-a9ef-4dd2-9980-98cb0d5b8682', 'multiverseId': 178627}, 'multiverseid': 178627}]", '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Schrein\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen Zauberspruch ausspielt, erhält er X Lebenspunkte dazu, wobei X die Anzahl an Karten mit dem gleichen Namen wie dieser Zauberspruch in allen Friedhöfen ist.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175717&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efe47ac0-49a3-4b22-a882-5928c400c2b7\', \'multiverseId\': 175717}, \'multiverseid\': 175717}, {\'name\': \'Altar aven\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador juegue un hechizo, ese jugador gana X vidas, donde X es el número de cartas que haya en todos los cementerios con el mismo nombre que ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4549375-cb58-492a-9b9d-04c0de19c2af\', \'multiverseId\': 177129}, \'multiverseid\': 177129}, {\'name\': \'Reliquaire des Avemains\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur joue un sort, ce joueur gagne X points de vie, X étant le nombre de cartes dans tous les cimetières ayant le même nom que ce sort.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176069&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31d7b8dc-d4c4-45f9-9108-70d473dc560a\', \'multiverseId\': 176069}, \'multiverseid\': 176069}, {\'name\': \'Santuario Aviano\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore gioca una magia, quel giocatore guadagna X punti vita, dove X è pari al numero di carte con lo stesso nome di quella magia presenti in tutti i cimiteri.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a21ea034-00ae-4397-bde1-ec0a0ad5911a\', \'multiverseId\': 176578}, \'multiverseid\': 176578}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの祭殿\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd0f7a68-4048-48b3-b3bb-b8ef7d6377d1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Sacrário Aviano\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador joga uma mágica, aquele jogador ganha X pontos de vida, onde X é igual ao número de cards com o mesmo nome daquela mágica em todos os cemitérios.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efac067f-8684-4dfb-bd42-ec5962f0e7c5\', \'multiverseId\': 178572}, \'multiverseid\': 178572}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Wolkenjäger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Avior-Wolkenjäger ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Als es zur Neuverteilung kam, bat der Adler darum, Mensch werden zu dürfen. Die Ahnfrau gewährte das Gebet zur Hälfte." —Sage der Nomaden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175715&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac405072-1791-41bd-a25b-9ed418224f3e\', \'multiverseId\': 175715}, \'multiverseid\': 175715}, {\'name\': \'Cazanubes aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Cazanubes aven entre en juego, destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'"En la Nueva Repartición, Águila suplicó ser humano. La Antepasada le concedió la mitad de esa súplica." —Mito nómada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d7a1b3e-e771-4e17-aaed-32cb115907e8\', \'multiverseId\': 177127}, \'multiverseid\': 177127}, {\'name\': \'Avemain chasse-nuage\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Avemain chasse-nuage arrive en jeu, détruisez l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Lors de la Grande Réattribution, les aigles demandèrent à devenir humains. Les Ancêtres exaucèrent cette prière à moitié. » —Mythe des nomades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176067&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae7916ec-a6e4-4b4a-8437-ad5c1261b74d\', \'multiverseId\': 176067}, \'multiverseid\': 176067}, {\'name\': \'Caccianubi Aviano\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Caccianubi Aviano entra in gioco, distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"Durante la Ridistribuzione, le Aquile chiesero di diventare umane. Gli Antenati esaudirono solo in parte la loro preghiera". —Mito nomade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5058d96f-ca60-4870-9e1d-d7f6b44109a7\', \'multiverseId\': 176576}, \'multiverseid\': 176576}, {\'name\': \'雲を追うエイヴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38a0a4ca-6fcf-480d-94df-87dee5bc447f\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Caça-nuvens Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Caça-nuvens Aviano entra em jogo, destrói o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': \'"Na nova Repartição,as Águias imploraram para ser humanas. A Ancestral concedeu metade daquela súplica." — Mito dos nômades\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4826514d-d969-463e-9efd-6cb0eef3c881\', \'multiverseId\': 178570}, \'multiverseid\': 178570}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aviorschwarm\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{W}: Der Aviorschwarm erhält +0/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'So wie jede weitere Feder den Flügel kräftiger macht, so wächst die Macht des Schwarms mit jedem weiteren Rekruten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175716&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6982edff-9726-4439-9895-db1a515f5876\', \'multiverseId\': 175716}, \'multiverseid\': 175716}, {\'name\': \'Parvada aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{W}: La Parvada aven obtiene +0/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'De la misma manera en que cada pluma agregada estabiliza el ala, la parvada se fortalece con cada miembro nuevo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3d5e373-3d03-4a60-9c1c-e3cde8692ae1\', \'multiverseId\': 177128}, \'multiverseid\': 177128}, {\'name\': "Nuée d\'avemains", \'text\': "Vol\\n{W}: La Nuée d\'avemains gagne +0/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Tout comme chaque plume renforce l\'aile, la nuée devient plus forte avec chaque nouvel arrivant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176068&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f471d94f-352a-42ed-bd5c-464867ea5b2e\', \'multiverseId\': 176068}, \'multiverseid\': 176068}, {\'name\': \'Stormo di Aviani\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{W}: Lo Stormo di Aviani prende +0/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': "Come ogni nuova piuma rende l\'ala più stabile, così lo stormo diventa più forte per ogni nuovo membro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24b73c98-9533-4d4f-b105-dc1f7a3958ef\', \'multiverseId\': 176577}, \'multiverseid\': 176577}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの群れ\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a35a1fb1-d370-413b-ac7d-e84e65a831a5\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Bando Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{W}: Bando Aviano recebe +0/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': \'Assim como cada pena adicionada estabiliza a asa, o bando se fortalece com cada novo membro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b241362c-b395-4501-a617-ace8f09839a7\', \'multiverseId\': 178571}, \'multiverseid\': 178571}]', '[{\'name\': \'Balanceakt\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler bestimmt eine Anzahl an bleibenden Karten, die er kontrolliert, in Höhe der Anzahl an bleibenden Karten, die der Spieler, der die wenigsten bleibenden Karten kontrolliert, kontrolliert, und opfert dann den Rest. Jeder Spieler wirft nach demselben Schema Karten aus seiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175718&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'276c918d-8980-49a3-816f-fadddc52343c\', \'multiverseId\': 175718}, \'multiverseid\': 175718}, {\'name\': \'Acto equilibrante\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador elige un número de permanentes que controle igual al número de permanentes controlados por el jugador que controle el menor número, luego sacrifica el resto. Cada jugador descarta cartas de su mano de la misma manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'061a93f5-9ae0-4e83-94ea-bb64502fe76b\', \'multiverseId\': 177130}, \'multiverseid\': 177130}, {\'name\': "Tours d\'équilibre", \'text\': "Chaque joueur choisit un nombre de permanents qu\'il contrôle égal au nombre de permanents du joueur qui en contrôle le moins, puis sacrifie les autres. Chaque joueur se défausse de cartes de sa main de la même manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176070&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ad7fc3a-41d7-4a64-bdb0-5b39d8c18b10\', \'multiverseId\': 176070}, \'multiverseid\': 176070}, {\'name\': \'Editto Compensatore\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore sceglie un numero di permanenti che controlla pari al numero di permanenti controllati dal giocatore che ne controlla di meno, poi sacrifica i rimanenti. Ogni giocatore scarta carte dalla propria mano allo stesso modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6d7a825-27a3-4adb-b68c-0a92e0a2379d\', \'multiverseId\': 176579}, \'multiverseid\': 176579}, {\'name\': \'平等化\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07bb00a6-7eaf-4cec-a9a9-633783f45c60\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ato Estabilizador\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador escolhe um número de permanentes que ele próprio controle igual ao número de permanentes controladas pelo jogador que controla o menor número de permanentes e depois sacrifica o resto. Cada jogador descarta cards de sua própria mão da mesma maneira.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'266826d9-06da-4459-b676-e36bc2b0f4d4\', \'multiverseId\': 178573}, \'multiverseid\': 178573}]', '[{\'name\': \'Balshan-Greif\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{1}{U}, wirf eine Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Bringe den Balshan-Greif auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Greif\', \'flavor\': \'Es hilft, wenn man eine zusätzliche Fluchtrichtung hat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175775&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9fffa85-0c48-4ccd-ae87-c23e31feeb50\', \'multiverseId\': 175775}, \'multiverseid\': 175775}, {\'name\': \'Grifo de Balshan\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{1}{U}, descartar una carta de tu mano: Regresa el Grifo de Balshan a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'Ayuda tener una dirección extra hacia donde correr.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92ab15ae-54fa-4e3d-a9d0-46c5c4b7dd6c\', \'multiverseId\': 177187}, \'multiverseid\': 177187}, {\'name\': \'Griffon du Balshan\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{1}{U}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte de votre main : Renvoyez le Griffon du Balshan dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : griffon\', \'flavor\': "Il est toujours utile d\'avoir une direction de plus vers où s\'enfuir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176127&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82ba8b7b-7989-4e02-8353-ad7082254a81\', \'multiverseId\': 176127}, \'multiverseid\': 176127}, {\'name\': \'Grifone di Balshan\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{1}{U}, Scarta una carta dalla tua mano: Il proprietario riprende in mano il Grifone di Balshan.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Grifone\', \'flavor\': \'Aiuta avere a disposizione una direzione in più per la fuga.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21a2b07d-408d-4082-acd4-08ca612e85a3\', \'multiverseId\': 176636}, \'multiverseid\': 176636}, {\'name\': \'ボールシャンのグリフィン\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53b4a13d-7c2d-495a-ac4c-b78111e29bec\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Grifo de Balshan\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{1}{U}, Descarte um card de sua mão: Devolve Grifo de Balshan para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'É de grande ajuda ter uma direção extra para onde correr.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1556b715-d049-427d-9766-d56ada5edd5d\', \'multiverseId\': 178630}, \'multiverseid\': 178630}]', '[{\'name\': \'Balshanischer Täuscher\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Balshanische Täuscher einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, zeigt dieser Spieler die obersten beiden Karten seiner Bibliothek offen vor. Bestimme eine dieser Karten und lege sie auf den Friedhof dieses Spielers.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175774&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f45f7b8-752d-4e78-87b0-6dcbbf6c266b\', \'multiverseId\': 175774}, \'multiverseid\': 175774}, {\'name\': \'Embaucador de Balshan\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Embaucador de Balshan haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador muestra las primeras dos cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca. Tú eliges una de esas cartas y la pones en su cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63e0a712-46ea-42b4-9755-5bc2898c049c\', \'multiverseId\': 177186}, \'multiverseid\': 177186}, {\'name\': \'Enjôleur balshanique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Enjôleur balshanique inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur révèle les deux cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Vous choisissez une de ces cartes et vous la mettez dans son cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176126&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e26407c4-fc32-46c3-9c68-fc1b43ddcd2e\', \'multiverseId\': 176126}, \'multiverseid\': 176126}, {\'name\': \'Ingannatore di Balshan\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Ingannatore di Balshan infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore rivela le prime due carte del proprio grimorio. Scegli una di quelle carte e mettila nel suo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af99c56a-1960-478e-aa61-ffbdf04dd5e3\', \'multiverseId\': 176635}, \'multiverseid\': 176635}, {\'name\': \'ボールシャンの詐欺師\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'430a51fc-4200-44ef-8498-6363d9f1f9ca\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Enganador de Balshan\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Enganador de Balshan causa dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador revela os dois primeiros cards de seu próprio grimório. Você escolhe um desses cards e o coloca no cemitério dele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'708ea2e2-ff48-4773-8eb5-017b3bbef653\', \'multiverseId\': 178629}, \'multiverseid\': 178629}]', '[{\'name\': \'Barbaren-Kampfring\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R}. Der Barbaren-Kampfring fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nGrenzwert {R}, {T}, opfere den Barbaren-Kampfring: Der Barbaren-Kampfring fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu. (Spiele diese Fähigkeit nur, falls sieben oder mehr Karten in deinem Friedhof sind.)\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176021&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ce93eb3-c55f-484c-bb46-4103005c5ed6\', \'multiverseId\': 176021}, \'multiverseid\': 176021}, {\'name\': \'Arena bárbara\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {R} a tu reserva de maná. La Arena bárbara te hace 1 punto de daño.\\nUmbral {R}, {T}, sacrificar la Arena bárbara: La Arena bárbara hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo. (Juega esta habilidad sólo si hay siete o más cartas en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6da8f09-25ca-4252-ac36-04d452b4ee2a\', \'multiverseId\': 177433}, \'multiverseid\': 177433}, {\'name\': \'Cercle des barbares\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {R} à votre réserve. Le Cercle des barbares vous inflige 1 blessure.\\nSeuil — {R}, {T}, sacrifiez le Cercle des barbares : Le Cercle des barbares inflige 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur. (Ne jouez cette capacité que s\'il y a sept cartes ou plus dans votre cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176373&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62e77782-bf8a-4959-9664-101cd44a5709\', \'multiverseId\': 176373}, \'multiverseid\': 176373}, {\'name\': \'Ring dei Barbari\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {R} alla tua riserva di mana. Il Ring dei Barbari ti infligge 1 danno.\\nSoglia {R}, {T}, Sacrifica il Ring dei Barbari: Il Ring dei Barbari infligge 2 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio (gioca questa abilità solo se ci sono almeno sette carte nel tuo cimitero).\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d713dabe-446b-4acc-a716-24baea2bc5db\', \'multiverseId\': 176882}, \'multiverseid\': 176882}, {\'name\': \'蛮族のリング\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'041cbf70-beb8-4cf4-a790-9c899f0eccb3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ringue dos Bárbaros\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adiciona {R} à sua reserva de mana. Ringue dos Bárbaros causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\\nLimiar — {R}, {T}, Sacrifique Ringue dos Bárbaros: Ringue dos Bárbaros causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura alvo ou jogador alvo. (Use esta habilidade apenas se você tiver sete ou mais cards em seu cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'567005e8-72e5-4f69-a3a7-9bc8284a80f9\', \'multiverseId\': 178876}, \'multiverseid\': 178876}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baumwipfelwachposten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Schutz vor Grün\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Auf seinen Streifflügen hatte Crian viele Gelegenheiten, unbemerkt Schüsse auf die "Schmutzkrabbler" am Boden abzugeben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175819&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f77d2370-45a2-4024-aac6-422b46d1e6c7\', \'multiverseId\': 175819}, \'multiverseid\': 175819}, {\'name\': \'Centinela de las copas\', \'text\': \'Vuela, protección contra verde.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'Las patrullas de Crian le dan mucha oportunidad de realizar tiros al azar a los "andatierras" que están debajo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d95304eb-0114-477d-af5b-d571cd88f240\', \'multiverseId\': 177231}, \'multiverseid\': 177231}, {\'name\': \'Sentinelle arboricole\', \'text\': \'Vol, protection contre le vert\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Durant ses patrouilles, Crihan profitait des nombreuses occasions de tir au jugé sur les « marche-poussière » du dessous.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176171&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02e8b14d-c12a-4ee8-9304-90978dff56f5\', \'multiverseId\': 176171}, \'multiverseid\': 176171}, {\'name\': \'Sentinella Arboricola\', \'text\': \'Volare, protezione dal verde\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Le pattuglie di Crian gli regalano molte opportunità per fare un po\\\' di tiro a segno con i "terricoli" di sotto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48de73b5-ce2c-4606-a535-9d8f711199a4\', \'multiverseId\': 176680}, \'multiverseid\': 176680}, {\'name\': \'樹上の歩哨\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1821ca27-5b12-45bf-a4e2-00082ab8b7e8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Sentinela das Copas\', \'text\': \'Voar, proteção contra o verde\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': \'As patrulhas de Crian dão a ele várias oportunidades de dar tiros rápidos nos "rastejantes" bem abaixo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfcd0a12-b3e3-4b49-8da7-6e3e6b28476b\', \'multiverseId\': 178674}, \'multiverseid\': 178674}]', '[{\'name\': \'Begegnung mit dem Glück\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Münzwurf gewinnst, lege eine Glücksmarke auf die Begegnung mit dem Glück.\\nFalls zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments zehn oder mehr Glücksmarken auf der Begegnung mit dem Glück liegen, gewinnst du das Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Je unwahrscheinlicher der Sieg, desto erinnerungswürdiger der Erfolg.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175890&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bae2419a-fac0-4690-9973-c501e4b75e30\', \'multiverseId\': 175890}, \'multiverseid\': 175890}, {\'name\': \'Encuentro fortuito\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes un lanzamiento de moneda, pon un contador de suerte sobre el Encuentro fortuito.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si el Encuentro fortuito tiene diez o más contadores de suerte sobre él, ganas el juego.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras más improbable es la victoria, más memorable es el éxito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03b7ee8a-6e00-487f-b992-581e5010e0a8\', \'multiverseId\': 177302}, \'multiverseid\': 177302}, {\'name\': \'Rencontre de hasard\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez un pile ou face, mettez un marqueur « chance » sur la Rencontre de hasard.\\nAu début de votre entretien, si la Rencontre de hasard a dix marqueurs « chance » ou plus sur elle, vous gagnez la partie.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Plus improbable la victoire, plus mémorable le succès.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176242&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'100a2c70-206c-4648-8fd7-7f3c6d384408\', \'multiverseId\': 176242}, \'multiverseid\': 176242}, {\'name\': \'Incontro Fortuito\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta vinci il lancio di una moneta, metti un segnalino fortuna sull\'Incontro Fortuito.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se l\'Incontro Fortuito ha dieci o più segnalini fortuna, vinci la partita.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Più improbabile è la vittoria, più memorabile è il successo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70e87c44-05d0-4ad6-a127-6fe89665074b\', \'multiverseId\': 176751}, \'multiverseid\': 176751}, {\'name\': \'偶然の出合い\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97c0c865-9404-40f7-82b8-86b9785989ac\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Encontro Casual\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganhar uma disputa de cara-ou-coroa, coloque um marcador de sorte em Encontro Casual.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, se Encontro Casual tiver dez ou mais marcadores de sorte, você ganha o jogo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Quanto mais improvável a vitória, mais memorável o sucesso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b219342b-bdd3-4a25-81e4-2c361a628e71\', \'multiverseId\': 178745}, \'multiverseid\': 178745}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beichtvater\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler eine Karte aus seiner Hand abwirft, kannst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazuerhalten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere Verluste werden entschädigt werden. Unsere Verfehlungen werden gesühnt werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175723&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd0eed2b-a653-4c52-bea6-d5a1990fb639\', \'multiverseId\': 175723}, \'multiverseid\': 175723}, {\'name\': \'Confesor\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador descarte una carta de su mano, puedes ganar 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Habrá ganancias por nuestras pérdidas. Habrá vindicaciones por nuestros agravios."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5db575f5-7f6c-4b23-943f-ad2054db5b77\', \'multiverseId\': 177135}, \'multiverseid\': 177135}, {\'name\': \'Confesseur\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur se défausse d\'une carte de sa main, vous pouvez gagner 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Il y aura des gains pour nos pertes. Il y aura du bien qui sortira du mal. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176075&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61644eb1-c740-4f0f-9138-7c52023e25a0\', \'multiverseId\': 176075}, \'multiverseid\': 176075}, {\'name\': \'Confessore\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore scarta una carta dalla propria mano, puoi guadagnare 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci saranno dei guadagni per le nostre perdite. Ci sarà giustizia per i torti subiti".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ada811c4-176c-4115-a88e-64aaf9d7a5f3\', \'multiverseId\': 176584}, \'multiverseid\': 176584}, {\'name\': \'聴罪司祭\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21a840aa-f094-4017-94be-da8f680815cd\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Confessor\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador descarta um card de sua própria mão, você pode ganhar 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Haverá ganhos por nossas perdas. Haverá correção para nossos erros."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b301924-19b5-42fb-a331-37aac07b02c4\', \'multiverseId\': 178578}, \'multiverseid\': 178578}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beliebter Kaplan\', \'text\': \'Schutz vor Kreaturen\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Nomaden und Nantuko, Adler und Elefanten; alle Vögel und Bestien sind von seiner sanften Würde verzaubert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175719&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0398225b-717d-45d3-ac73-06da706bcc1b\', \'multiverseId\': 175719}, \'multiverseid\': 175719}, {\'name\': \'Capellán amado\', \'text\': \'Protección contra criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Nómada y nantuko, águila y elefante; todas las aves y bestias son seducidas por su dignidad serena.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11944756-d2dd-49d1-87a0-47e7ae0fa738\', \'multiverseId\': 177131}, \'multiverseid\': 177131}, {\'name\': \'Aumônier bien-aimé\', \'text\': \'Protection contre les créatures\', \'type\': \'Créature : clerc\', \'flavor\': "Que ce soit les nomades ou les nantukos, l\'aigle ou l\'éléphant, tout ce qui vole ou qui rampe est charmé par sa calme dignité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176071&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bee05f3-ee7a-40bc-a3ee-8006d27540a3\', \'multiverseId\': 176071}, \'multiverseid\': 176071}, {\'name\': \'Capellano Adorato\', \'text\': \'Protezione dalle creature\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico\', \'flavor\': \'Nomadi e nantuko, aquile ed elefanti; tutti gli uccelli e le bestie sono incantati dalla sua quieta dignità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b467f9c0-7802-45a0-af31-3b53078aea3c\', \'multiverseId\': 176580}, \'multiverseid\': 176580}, {\'name\': \'敬愛される司祭\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16a32e95-d725-496a-aebd-1ba5cd74f717\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Capelão Adorado\', \'text\': \'Proteção contra criaturas\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Nômades e Nantukos, águias e elefantes; todos os pássaros e bestas são encantados por sua dignidade serena.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88a1d5fd-4435-4bf1-8c21-4db9251e211c\', \'multiverseId\': 178574}, \'multiverseid\': 178574}]', '[{\'name\': \'Berührung der Unsichtbarkeit\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ist in diesem Zug unblockbar.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Zephaliden arbeiten gerne unsichtbar, sei es in der Politik, beim Betrügen oder auch einfach nur so.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175817&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd4196a6-5c6f-4070-bb18-12f368dbb1f3\', \'multiverseId\': 175817}, \'multiverseid\': 175817}, {\'name\': \'Toque de invisibilidad\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo es imbloqueable este turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los cefálidos se especializan en cosas que no se ven, ya sea la política, la traición o ellos mismos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a9a8f54-853c-44dd-8afb-9920d494e293\', \'multiverseId\': 177229}, \'multiverseid\': 177229}, {\'name\': "Toucher d\'invisibilité", \'text\': \'La créature ciblée est imblocable ce tour-ci.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les céphalides adorent ce qui est invisible et discret : la politique, la traîtrise, eux-mêmes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176169&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01e7b2a8-8fdb-485f-9de1-3802004ae855\', \'multiverseId\': 176169}, \'multiverseid\': 176169}, {\'name\': "Tocco d\'Invisibilità", \'text\': \'La creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I cefalidi sono specializzati in cose invisibili, che si tratti di politica, tradimenti o loro stessi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbd3649f-ac9d-4cf1-a6e0-168149e95944\', \'multiverseId\': 176678}, \'multiverseid\': 176678}, {\'name\': \'一瞬の不可視\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba0d72bc-4b39-4f8e-a2a0-016193926ee8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Toque de Invisibilidade\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os cefálidas especializaram-se em coisas invisíveis, seja política, traição, ou eles próprios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b0984e0-9710-4aef-90d5-1c53d031597f\', \'multiverseId\': 178672}, \'multiverseid\': 178672}]', "[{'name': 'Bestienangriff', 'text': 'Bringe einen 4/4 grünen Bestienspielstein ins Spiel.\\nRückblende {2}{G}{G}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten spielen. Entferne sie dann ganz aus dem Spiel.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175938&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f345a24e-d74d-4ae6-b2ab-f2354c99c421', 'multiverseId': 175938}, 'multiverseid': 175938}, {'name': 'Ataque de bestia', 'text': 'Pon en juego una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 4/4.\\nRetrospectiva {2}{G}{G}{G}. (Puedes jugar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego remuévela del juego.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177350&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6de6a1e9-b614-4717-b9c0-32e2ac3aa973', 'multiverseId': 177350}, 'multiverseid': 177350}, {'name': 'Attaque de la bête', 'text': 'Mettez en jeu un jeton de créature 4/4 verte Bête.\\nFlashback {2}{G}{G}{G} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Retirez-la ensuite de la partie.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176290&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b45468b-4a23-4474-8074-46b47bed8c52', 'multiverseId': 176290}, 'multiverseid': 176290}, {'name': 'Attacco Bestiale', 'text': 'Metti in gioco una pedina creatura Bestia 4/4 verde.\\nFlashback {2}{G}{G}{G} (puoi giocare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi rimuovila dal gioco).', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176799&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3891eec-2d66-4e12-be0d-634a9c3f7387', 'multiverseId': 176799}, 'multiverseid': 176799}, {'name': '獣の襲撃', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '610504a5-62b1-4dd8-9508-a3b07964afbe'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ataque das Bestas', 'text': 'Coloque em jogo uma ficha de criatura verde 4/4 do tipo Besta.\\nRecapitular {2}{G}{G}{G} (Você pode jogar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitulação. Depois remova-o do jogo.)', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178793&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd933e1ff-fcfa-4868-a8f4-54faf0642c01', 'multiverseId': 178793}, 'multiverseid': 178793}]", "[{'name': 'Besudelte Zitadelle', 'text': '{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein farbloses Mana.{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n Die Besudelte Zitadelle fügt dir 3 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176037&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77fdc8e6-4510-45f0-910b-b9899b191c06', 'multiverseId': 176037}, 'multiverseid': 176037}, {'name': 'Ciudadela manchada', 'text': '{T}: Agrega un maná incoloro a tu reserva de maná.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná. La Ciudadela manchada te hace 3 puntos de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177449&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42ed9de7-960c-4c3f-bb85-cc92447e7efc', 'multiverseId': 177449}, 'multiverseid': 177449}, {'name': 'Citadelle ternie', 'text': '{T}: Ajoutez un mana incolore à votre réserve.\\n{T}: Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve. La Citadelle ternie vous inflige 3 blessures.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176389&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1dbd4a1f-d29a-4f84-96a0-be921b63fa7d', 'multiverseId': 176389}, 'multiverseid': 176389}, {'name': 'Cittadella Annerita', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi un mana incolore alla tua riserva.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva. La Cittadella Annerita ti infligge 3 danni.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176898&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e178062a-eca8-4db3-b2ce-75d681b24aaf', 'multiverseId': 176898}, 'multiverseid': 176898}, {'name': '色あせた城塞', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01f3f1f1-8079-4124-b0f1-e5614685190d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cidadela Opaca', 'text': '{T}: Adiciona uma mana incolor à sua reserva de mana.\\n{T}: Adiciona uma mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana. Cidadela Opaca causa 3 pontos de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178892&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d8d5433-f831-4423-a40f-0ccf6cb55549', 'multiverseId': 178892}, 'multiverseid': 178892}]", "[{'name': 'Blut der Unschuldigen', 'text': 'Jeder Spieler opfert eine Kreatur.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Zombies bedauern die Lebenden und freuen sich für diejenigen, denen bald das Geschenk des Todes gegeben wird.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175853&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '384a83bb-c0b8-4f5c-8cd5-f52a014223d5', 'multiverseId': 175853}, 'multiverseid': 175853}, {'name': 'Sangre inocente', 'text': 'Cada jugador sacrifica una criatura.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Los zombies se acongojan por los vivos y celebran a aquéllos que pronto recibirán el regalo de la muerte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177265&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e75c56db-08f4-456d-b92a-11f75ad29db5', 'multiverseId': 177265}, 'multiverseid': 177265}, {'name': 'Sang des innocents', 'text': 'Chaque joueur sacrifie une créature.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Les zombies se lamentent pour les vivants et se réjouissent pour ceux qui vont mourir.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176205&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'adb65d71-55c5-4ff3-bd03-b36a51f0742b', 'multiverseId': 176205}, 'multiverseid': 176205}, {'name': 'Sangue Innocente', 'text': 'Ogni giocatore sacrifica una creatura.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Gli zombie compiangono i viventi e festeggiano coloro a cui verrà presto fatto il dono della morte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176714&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47014888-7796-4e14-a88d-ab8d2b4b4ac3', 'multiverseId': 176714}, 'multiverseid': 176714}, {'name': '無垢の血', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cabad0f-5831-4217-b167-52648a525089'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sangue dos Inocentes', 'text': 'Cada jogador sacrifica uma criatura.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Os zumbis lamentam pelos vivos e celebram por aqueles que logo receberão a dádiva da morte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178708&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '191a3883-1eff-4d28-9876-2f67741a737d', 'multiverseId': 178708}, 'multiverseid': 178708}]", "[{'name': 'Blättertänzer', 'text': 'Waldtarnung', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zentaur', 'flavor': 'Ein Blättertänzer streift durch den Wald wie ein Frühlingswind und entzieht sich selbst den schärfsten Augen und Ohren.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175957&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ead8cc47-14c6-48d7-8d61-b0158b49ee36', 'multiverseId': 175957}, 'multiverseid': 175957}, {'name': 'Bailarín de las hojas', 'text': 'Cruza bosques.', 'type': 'Criatura — Centauro', 'flavor': 'Un bailarín de las hojas atraviesa el bosque como una brisa de primavera, eludiendo incluso a los ojos y oídos más agudos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177369&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4750d0a2-cfa6-4e03-a12e-3cbf309264d4', 'multiverseId': 177369}, 'multiverseid': 177369}, {'name': 'Danse-feuille', 'text': 'Traversée des forêts', 'type': 'Créature : centaure', 'flavor': 'Léger, silencieux, invisible, le danse-feuille traverse la forêt comme une brise de printemps.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176309&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5608d6e-cd31-4348-97ac-603c94b48e63', 'multiverseId': 176309}, 'multiverseid': 176309}, {'name': 'Danzatore delle Foglie', 'text': 'Passa-foreste', 'type': 'Creatura — Centauro', 'flavor': 'Un danzatore delle foglie si muove attraverso la foresta come una brezza primaverile, sfuggendo persino allo sguardo più acuto e alle orecchie più sensibili.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176818&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1866bd82-11dc-46c0-852e-55ecb87f6ff9', 'multiverseId': 176818}, 'multiverseid': 176818}, {'name': '葉の踊り手', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb681ad6-7e14-4689-9a02-bde60b4da1f4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Dançarino das Folhas', 'text': 'Travessia de Floresta', 'type': 'Criatura — Centauro', 'flavor': 'Um dançarino das folhas desliza pela floresta como uma brisa da primavera, escapando até mesmo aos olhos e ouvidos mais aguçados.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178812&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4bf83766-3a23-49b2-82de-db56ac8f6832', 'multiverseId': 178812}, 'multiverseid': 178812}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blütenfolge\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine grüne Nichtspielstein-Kreatur aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kann der Beherrscher dieser Kreatur seine Bibliothek nach einer Karte mit dem selben Namen durchsuchen und diese ins Spiel bringen. Falls dieser Spieler dies tut, mischt er danach seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175988&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'476fcc7a-87d6-4edb-9817-b50c822033c8\', \'multiverseId\': 175988}, \'multiverseid\': 175988}, {\'name\': \'Descendencia verdosa\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura verde que no sea ficha vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, el controlador de esa criatura puede buscar en su biblioteca una carta que tenga el mismo nombre que esa criatura y ponerla en juego. Si ese jugador lo hace, luego él baraja su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54e4a0a7-d2c7-43c1-90bf-cf75ec8a05b9\', \'multiverseId\': 177400}, \'multiverseid\': 177400}, {\'name\': \'Succession verdoyante\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature verte non-jeton est mise dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, le contrôleur de cette créature peut chercher une carte ayant le même nom que cette créature dans sa bibliothèque et la mettre en jeu. Si ce joueur fait ainsi, il mélange ensuite sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176340&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fb8b90b-b372-48a1-b2be-d603c3e8575f\', \'multiverseId\': 176340}, \'multiverseid\': 176340}, {\'name\': \'Rotazione dei Pascoli\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura non pedina verde viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, il controllore di quella creatura può passare in rassegna il proprio grimorio, scegliere una carta con lo stesso nome di quella creatura e metterla in gioco. Se quel giocatore lo fa, poi rimescola il proprio grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'816b05f1-0572-452e-8f7d-9adad2bcccb0\', \'multiverseId\': 176849}, \'multiverseid\': 176849}, {\'name\': \'新緑の連続\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aa1785b-3fde-4b5b-a0ef-97f1eb3203f1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Sucessão Verdejante\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura verde que não seja um ficha for colocada em um cemitério vinda de jogo, o controlador daquela criatura pode procurar em seu próprio grimório por um card com o mesmo nome daquela criatura e colocá-lo em jogo. Se aquele jogador o fizer, ele embaralha seu próprio grimório depois disso.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'530ae1cc-d921-4b64-aeee-ba16455b975a\', \'multiverseId\': 178843}, \'multiverseid\': 178843}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bodensiegel\', \'text\': \'Ziehe eine Karte, wenn das Bodensiegel ins Spiel kommt.\\nKarten in Friedhöfen können nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Lass das, was begraben ist, auch für immer begraben sein." —Seton, Zentaurendruide\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175950&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5af6d3dc-fafb-4fea-b95e-c710f30074b4\', \'multiverseId\': 175950}, \'multiverseid\': 175950}, {\'name\': \'Sello terrestre\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Sello terrestre entre en juego, roba una carta.\\nLas cartas de los cementerios no pueden ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Que todo lo que hemos enterrado esté enterrado eternamente." —Seton, druida centauro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a966aad-2a71-4d77-a24a-ec80d51517ce\', \'multiverseId\': 177362}, \'multiverseid\': 177362}, {\'name\': \'Sceau cthonien\', \'text\': \'Quand le Sceau cthonien arrive en jeu, piochez une carte.\\nLes cartes des cimetières ne peuvent être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Que ceux qui sont enterrés le restent à jamais.» —Selton, druide centaure.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176302&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97d9aae3-bff4-4c9e-aa7b-b28b2869dce4\', \'multiverseId\': 176302}, \'multiverseid\': 176302}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Terreno\', \'text\': \'Quando il Sigillo Terreno entra in gioco, pesca una carta.\\nLe carte nei cimiteri non possono essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lasciamo che tutto ciò che abbiamo sepolto resti sepolto per sempre". —Seton, druido centauro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'273f7e79-bc29-467c-bc10-bfa92e1e121c\', \'multiverseId\': 176811}, \'multiverseid\': 176811}, {\'name\': \'地の封印\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'408a85a3-3bdf-4aec-9cc0-ce8326c08094\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Selo da Terra\', \'text\': \'Quando Selo da Terra entra em jogo, compre um card.\\nOs cards nos cemitérios não podem ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Que tudo o que enterramos fique enterrado para sempre." — Seton, druida centauro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d205b414-6854-433d-a72a-17c73593a79a\', \'multiverseId\': 178805}, \'multiverseid\': 178805}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bombenkommando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Lege eine Zündermarke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nLege zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zündermarke auf jede Kreatur, auf der bereits mindestens eine Zündermarke liegt.\\nImmer wenn auf einer Kreatur vier oder mehr Zündermarken liegen, entferne alle Zündermarken von ihr und zerstöre sie. Diese Kreatur fügt ihrem Beherrscher 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175887&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f00ccad4-31c4-4f79-8205-ec098f9d2aa8\', \'multiverseId\': 175887}, \'multiverseid\': 175887}, {\'name\': \'Escuadrón de bombas\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pon un contador de mecha sobre la criatura objetivo.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon un contador de mecha sobre cada criatura que tenga un contador de mecha sobre ella.\\nSiempre que una criatura tenga cuatro o más contadores de mecha sobre ella, remueve todos los contadores de mecha de ella y destrúyela. Esa criatura hace 4 puntos de daño a su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Enano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d682a4e5-069d-4be5-b464-73e93c227266\', \'multiverseId\': 177299}, \'multiverseid\': 177299}, {\'name\': \'Poseurs de bombes\', \'text\': "{T}: Mettez un marqueur « mèche » sur la créature ciblée.\\nAu début de votre entretien, mettez un marqueur « mèche » sur chaque créature avec un marqueur « mèche » sur elle.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature a quatre marqueurs « mèche » ou plus sur elle, retirez tous les marqueurs « mèche » sur elle et détruisez-la. Cette créature inflige 4 blessures à son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Créature : nain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176239&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de42f287-5bbf-4b96-89c7-162e5a5a8b9c\', \'multiverseId\': 176239}, \'multiverseid\': 176239}, {\'name\': \'Squadra di Guastatori\', \'text\': "{T}: Metti un segnalino miccia su una creatura bersaglio.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti un segnalino miccia su ogni creatura che ha già almeno un segnalino miccia su di essa.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura ha quattro o più segnalini miccia, rimuovi da essa tutti i segnalini miccia e distruggila. Quella creatura infligge 4 danni al proprio controllore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Nano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a219f5d1-5c1a-496e-8d8c-a3ddd5f2e831\', \'multiverseId\': 176748}, \'multiverseid\': 176748}, {\'name\': \'爆弾部隊\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'577f5a43-3ad1-4f1e-a9b8-6f891fb78e37\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Esquadrão de Bombas\', \'text\': \'{T}: Coloque um marcador de estopim na criatura alvo.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, coloque um marcador de estopim em cada criatura que tenha um marcador de estopim.\\nToda vez que uma criatura tiver quatro ou mais destes marcadores, remova todos os marcadores de estopim dela e destrua-a. Aquela criatura causa 4 pontos de dano ao seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16e50911-7263-4deb-b66b-05b50edc2467\', \'multiverseId\': 178742}, \'multiverseid\': 178742}]', '[{\'name\': \'Braids, die Kabbalistin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments jedes Spielers opfert dieser Spieler ein Artefakt, eine Kreatur oder ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Diener, Legende\', \'flavor\': \'„Heimat ist dort, wo man einen netten Friedhof finden kann, und wo Fremde verschwinden können, ohne dass gleich seltsame Fragen gestellt werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175825&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'234f569e-8a82-4e40-baa0-af93316e603f\', \'multiverseId\': 175825}, \'multiverseid\': 175825}, {\'name\': \'Trenzas, sicaria de la Cábala\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del mantenimiento de cada jugador, ese jugador sacrifica un artefacto, criatura o tierra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sicario legendario\', \'flavor\': \'"El hogar es donde puedes encontrar un cementerio decente y los desconocidos pueden desaparecer sin que haya preguntas incómodas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25ec5214-bd5e-4f0c-a7f2-69944460e141\', \'multiverseId\': 177237}, \'multiverseid\': 177237}, {\'name\': \'Nattes, séide de la Coterie\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'entretien de chaque joueur, ce joueur sacrifie un artefact, une créature ou un terrain.", \'type\': \'Créature : mignon et légende\', \'flavor\': "« Je suis chez moi partout où je peux trouver un cimetière décent, et où l\'on ne pose pas de questions lorsque des étrangers disparaissent.»", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176177&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42f9adbe-77c9-4bc5-b864-f0aa6327546b\', \'multiverseId\': 176177}, \'multiverseid\': 176177}, {\'name\': \'Braids, Servitore della Cabala\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del mantenimento di ogni giocatore, quel giocatore sacrifica un artefatto, una creatura o una terra.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Leggenda Servitore\', \'flavor\': \'"La mia casa è dove c\\\'è un cimitero decente e dove gli stranieri possono sparire senza che nessuno faccia domande indiscrete".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cf2c19c-85bd-4901-8721-4bc10b976f91\', \'multiverseId\': 176686}, \'multiverseid\': 176686}, {\'name\': \'陰謀団の先手ブレイズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d896b054-3336-4aba-9922-27381cdc9a59\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Braids, Assecla da Cabala\', \'text\': \'No início da manutenção de cada jogador, aquele jogador sacrifica um artefato, uma criatura ou um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Assecla Lenda\', \'flavor\': \'"O lar é onde você pode encontrar um cemitério decente e onde estranhos podem desaparecer sem que isso provoque perguntas inoportunas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4404a1f8-7b45-4a12-9c74-fa047bc22688\', \'multiverseId\': 178680}, \'multiverseid\': 178680}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brennende Gruft\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl entfernt alle Karten mit Rückblende in seinem Friedhof ganz aus dem Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die zärtlichsten Erinnerungen brennen am hellsten. Die Flammen scheinen es zu genießen, sie zu verzehren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175873&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44c35b85-663c-4211-b537-0f3c5941b21f\', \'multiverseId\': 175873}, \'multiverseid\': 175873}, {\'name\': \'Fuego sepulcral\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo remueve del juego todas las cartas que tengan retrospectiva de su cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los recuerdos más queridos son los que brillan más cuando se queman. Al perderse para siempre, las llamas aumentan de temperatura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90f340e5-1147-430a-9cc5-3c0e54e6b8c6\', \'multiverseId\': 177285}, \'multiverseid\': 177285}, {\'name\': \'Tombefeu\', \'text\': \'Le joueur ciblé retire de la partie toutes les cartes avec le flashback de son cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Nos plus chers souvenirs enflamment nos mémoires. Plus ils s\'éloignent, plus la brûlure est douloureuse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176225&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'948bf5cf-6293-4718-887c-b096cb9d745c\', \'multiverseId\': 176225}, \'multiverseid\': 176225}, {\'name\': \'Fuoco Tombale\', \'text\': \'Il giocatore bersaglio rimuove dal gioco tutte le carte con flashback presenti nel suo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Le memorie più care sono quelle che bruciano più intensamente. Quando vengono perdute per sempre le fiamme diventano ancora più intense.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba1355d0-db56-4bfe-95b7-e9035fef02a6\', \'multiverseId\': 176734}, \'multiverseid\': 176734}, {\'name\': \'墓火\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49f31dfe-e0e0-4034-a791-9cdd08d25ebb\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Chamas Tumulares\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo remove de jogo todos os cards com a habilidade de recapitular que estão em seu próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'As lembranças mais queridas queimam com mais brilho. Conforme se perdem para sempre, as chamas ficam cada vez mais quentes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9378a872-12a2-4efe-95a3-510b09f8868f\', \'multiverseId\': 178728}, \'multiverseid\': 178728}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brennender Sand\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, opfert der Beherrscher dieser Kreatur ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Schmerz lehrt einem Sachen, die einem kein Philosoph beibringen kann." —Kamahl, Grubenkämpfer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175888&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cddd72d-8c4a-4c51-aaad-9c12e1ef7dfc\', \'multiverseId\': 175888}, \'multiverseid\': 175888}, {\'name\': \'Arenas ardientes\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, el controlador de esa criatura sacrifica una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"El dolor enseña lecciones que ningún erudito puede enseñar." —Kamahl, luchador del foso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bb92eb2-9c67-47d8-be5c-656a93c672e4\', \'multiverseId\': 177300}, \'multiverseid\': 177300}, {\'name\': \'Sables brûlants\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature est mise dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, son contrôleur sacrifie un terrain.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« La douleur donne des leçons qu\'aucun professeur ne peut enseigner. » —Kamahl, sangrahbaire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176240&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff663eb6-a520-466c-8ec0-74eb9234732e\', \'multiverseId\': 176240}, \'multiverseid\': 176240}, {\'name\': \'Sabbie Brucianti\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, il controllore di quella creatura sacrifica una terra.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il dolore impartisce delle lezioni che nessun erudito potrebbe dare". —Kamahl, combattente dell\\\'arena\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94878725-f0ae-4f6f-82d2-c2237d3ebe89\', \'multiverseId\': 176749}, \'multiverseid\': 176749}, {\'name\': \'熱砂\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'543eaa5c-84de-4006-b4b9-a6503daa900d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Areias Escaldantes\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura for colocada em um cemitério vinda do jogo, o controlador daquela criatura sacrifica um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Com a dor aprende-se lições que nenhum erudito é capaz de ensinar." —Kamahl, lutador da liça\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f14d0116-9132-4fab-a279-05ff542a4f8a\', \'multiverseId\': 178743}, \'multiverseid\': 178743}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bärental\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}, entferne zwei Karten aus deinem Friedhof ganz aus dem Spiel: Bringe einen 2/2 grünen Bärenspielstein ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Natur ist ein endloser Tanz zwischen Leben und Tod." —Seton, Zentaurendruide\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175937&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80838c2a-1c2d-4656-943f-b60a3e92392f\', \'multiverseId\': 175937}, \'multiverseid\': 175937}, {\'name\': \'Paisajoso\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}, remover del juego dos cartas de tu cementerio: Pon en juego una ficha de criatura Oso verde 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"La naturaleza es la danza interminable entre la vida y la muerte." —Seton, druida centauro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6049b0ed-d8b4-4e52-8c1e-16de2435bc5f\', \'multiverseId\': 177349}, \'multiverseid\': 177349}, {\'name\': \'Pays des ours\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}, retirez de la partie deux cartes de votre cimetière : Mettez en jeu un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Ours.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« La nature est une danse sans fin entre la vie et la mort. » —Selton, druide centaure.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176289&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51be21f9-8d9f-43a8-944a-e571171aa7db\', \'multiverseId\': 176289}, \'multiverseid\': 176289}, {\'name\': \'Orsolandia\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}, Rimuovi dal gioco due carte presenti nel tuo cimitero: Metti in gioco una pedina creatura Orso 2/2 verde.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"La natura è la danza eterna tra la vita e la morte". —Seton, druido centauro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79df2eee-82f2-4de5-8af3-29bf2888aecc\', \'multiverseId\': 176798}, \'multiverseid\': 176798}, {\'name\': \'熊の谷\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e45e9fc-b118-4a17-8ef2-5bb2197e4c17\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Vale dos Ursos\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}, Remova de jogo dois cards de seu cemitério: Coloque em jogo uma ficha de criatura verde 2/2 do tipo Urso.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"A natureza é a dança sem fim entre a vida e a morte." — Seton, druida centauro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecdba160-09fe-4284-ba60-6e59861b9ba1\', \'multiverseId\': 178792}, \'multiverseid\': 178792}]', '[{\'name\': \'Böses Erwachen\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}{B}, opfere eine Kreatur: Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die beliebtesten Grubenkämpfer wurden zurückgebracht, um Zugaben geben zu können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175855&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aac47f7d-f31a-4eae-a61c-028237855390\', \'multiverseId\': 175855}, \'multiverseid\': 175855}, {\'name\': \'Despertar malevolente\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}{B}, sacrificar una criatura: Regresa la carta objetivo de criatura de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'A los luchadores del foso más populares los traen de vuelta para repeticiones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a702d83-9478-463b-bee5-55d22eabb71d\', \'multiverseId\': 177267}, \'multiverseid\': 177267}, {\'name\': \'Éveil malveillant\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}{B}, sacrifiez une créature : Renvoyez la carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les plus populaires des combattants des sangrahbas revenaient faire un rappel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176207&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7ea3fe6-b423-4357-9a5c-111b4ee95c81\', \'multiverseId\': 176207}, \'multiverseid\': 176207}, {\'name\': \'Risveglio Malevolo\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}{B}, Sacrifica una creatura: Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "I combattenti dell\'arena più amati dal pubblico vengono riportati in vita per fare il bis.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'780a7342-0c39-42f7-8744-ed095b5c3036\', \'multiverseId\': 176716}, \'multiverseid\': 176716}, {\'name\': \'邪悪な覚醒\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e5dd524-fb3d-45a0-a16d-5fe05406202f\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Despertar Malevolente\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}{B}, Sacrifique uma criatura: Devolve a criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os mais populares lutadores da liça são trazidos de volta para novas apresentações.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c70e3a84-cd6c-4dbe-8d75-8e1600935329\', \'multiverseId\': 178710}, \'multiverseid\': 178710}]', '[{\'name\': \'Carpe Diem\', \'text\': \'Enttappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Nach dieser Phase ist eine zusätzliche Kampfphase, der eine zusätzliche Hauptphase folgt.\\nRückblende {2}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten spielen. Entferne sie dann ganz aus dem Spiel.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175928&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e363828-4e61-43cc-8eed-cdaf8a9482d3\', \'multiverseId\': 175928}, \'multiverseid\': 175928}, {\'name\': \'Aprovechar el día\', \'text\': \'Endereza la criatura objetivo. Después de esta fase, hay una fase de combate adicional seguida por una fase principal adicional.\\nRetrospectiva {2}{R}. (Puedes jugar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego remuévela del juego.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e74b0c8b-5fd7-4c8e-a937-f67f0b8b0033\', \'multiverseId\': 177340}, \'multiverseid\': 177340}, {\'name\': \'Feu de tout bois\', \'text\': "Dégagez la créature ciblée. Cette phase est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire, puis d\'une phase principale supplémentaire.\\nFlashback {2}{R} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Retirez-la ensuite de la partie.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176280&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78b8b065-4ac8-41db-a863-2fc6e62e1c02\', \'multiverseId\': 176280}, \'multiverseid\': 176280}, {\'name\': "Cogli l\'Attimo", \'text\': "STAPpa una creatura bersaglio. Dopo questa fase, c\'è una fase di combattimento addizionale seguita da una fase principale addizionale.\\nFlashback {2}{R} (puoi giocare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi rimuovila dal gioco).", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84613cf4-91fc-4db4-947a-846a2548e3bf\', \'multiverseId\': 176789}, \'multiverseid\': 176789}, {\'name\': \'今を生きる\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80c362ec-2d0e-41a2-8560-b4104212ec5e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ganhar o Dia\', \'text\': \'Desvira a criatura alvo. Após esta fase, há uma fase adicional de combate seguida por uma fase principal adicional.\\nRecapitular {2}{R} (Você pode jogar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitulação. Depois remova-o do jogo.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53d5c537-01fc-4523-add9-20d043a3f5df\', \'multiverseId\': 178783}, \'multiverseid\': 178783}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chlorofant\', \'text\': \'Du kannst zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine +1/+1Marke auf den Chlorofant legen.\\nGrenzwert Du kannst zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine zusätzliche +1/+1-Marke auf den Chlorofant legen. (Du hast den Grenzwert erreicht, solange sieben oder mehr Karten in deinem Friedhof sind.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175942&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db2dc151-70e6-414f-9102-666ec3d0761f\', \'multiverseId\': 175942}, \'multiverseid\': 175942}, {\'name\': \'Clorofante\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes poner un contador +1/+1 sobre el Clorofante.\\nUmbral Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes poner otro contador +1/+1 sobre el Clorofante. (Tienes umbral mientras haya siete o más cartas en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2575fe7-f2a5-4111-a554-d708a22fde99\', \'multiverseId\': 177354}, \'multiverseid\': 177354}, {\'name\': \'Chlorophant\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Chlorophant.\\nSeuil — Au début de votre entretien, vous pouvez mettre un autre marqueur +1/+1 sur le Chlorophant. (Vous avez le seuil tant qu\'il y a sept cartes ou plus dans votre cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176294&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'796b68b7-d79a-4d1c-8e19-a15961fd15e0\', \'multiverseId\': 176294}, \'multiverseid\': 176294}, {\'name\': \'Clorofante\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi mettere un segnalino +1/+1 sul Clorofante.\\nSoglia All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi mettere un altro segnalino +1/+1 sul Clorofante (hai soglia fintanto che ci sono almeno sette carte nel tuo cimitero).", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca759af4-e8b8-4d49-a330-11acabe28c92\', \'multiverseId\': 176803}, \'multiverseid\': 176803}, {\'name\': \'クロロファント\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14c8c2d4-8724-44dc-930c-2ff866093c73\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Clorofante\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção você pode colocar um marcador +1/+1 em Clorofante.\\nLimiar — No início de sua manutenção, você pode colocar um outro marcador +1/+1 em Clorofante. (Você atinge o limiar desde que haja sete ou mais cards em seu cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47e50c62-6326-4017-8fea-7289b3d35ce5\', \'multiverseId\': 178797}, \'multiverseid\': 178797}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dampfklauengräber\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Entferne eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ganz aus dem Spiel.\\n{1}, opfere den Dampfklauengräber: Entferne eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ganz aus dem Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Manche sind tot, und manche sind richtig tot." —Lenker des Dampfklauengräbers\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176018&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43da7e9d-f1e0-4d53-b524-1c8f3c413bda\', \'multiverseId\': 176018}, \'multiverseid\': 176018}, {\'name\': \'Garra de vapor\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Remueve del juego la carta objetivo de un cementerio.\\n{1}, sacrificar la Garra de vapor: Remueve del juego la carta objetivo de un cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Están los muertos, y están los muertos muertos." —Conductor de una garra de vapor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e5e3d60-8e31-43ed-8d51-43d32963fd85\', \'multiverseId\': 177430}, \'multiverseid\': 177430}, {\'name\': \'Vapogriffe\', \'text\': "{3}, {T}: Retirez de la partie la carte ciblée d\'un cimetière.\\n{1}, sacrifiez le Vapogriffe : Retirez de la partie la carte ciblée d\'un cimetière.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Il y a les morts, et il y a les morts morts.» —Un conducteur de vapogriffe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176370&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aba3fd05-86ce-4104-81ee-fe8342704c03\', \'multiverseId\': 176370}, \'multiverseid\': 176370}, {\'name\': \'Vaporartiglio\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Rimuovi dal gioco una carta bersaglio presente in un cimitero.\\n{1}, Sacrifica il Vaporartiglio: Rimuovi dal gioco una carta bersaglio presente in un cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci sono i morti e poi ci sono i morti morti". —pilota del Vaporartiglio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6997d7fa-8e2d-4ca1-8aea-d98e9c04497e\', \'multiverseId\': 176879}, \'multiverseid\': 176879}, {\'name\': \'蒸気爪\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6443c15-e787-4089-b301-d59ccda18dce\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Escavadeira a Vapor\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Remove de jogo o card alvo que esteja em um cemitério.\\n{1}, Sacrifique Escavadeira a Vapor: Remove de jogo o card alvo que esteja em um cemitério\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Existem os mortos e existem os mortos mortos." — Operador da escavadeira a vapor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e3f1462-64dc-4290-9e03-ced1b20bf283\', \'multiverseId\': 178873}, \'multiverseid\': 178873}]', "[{'name': 'Dampfranken', 'text': 'Zerstöre das verzauberte Land, wenn es getappt wird, und die Dampfranken fügen dem Beherrscher dieses Landes 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Dieser Spieler bewegt dann die Dampfranken auf ein Land, das er bestimmt.', 'type': 'Landverzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175931&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab66a02e-7e2c-4d36-ad22-92fad66d5b21', 'multiverseId': 175931}, 'multiverseid': 175931}, {'name': 'Enredaderas de vapor', 'text': 'Cuando la tierra encantada se gire, destrúyela, y las Enredaderas de vapor hacen 1 punto de daño al controlador de esa tierra. Ese jugador mueve las Enredaderas de vapor a una tierra de su elección.', 'type': 'Encantar tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177343&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b68f4ac-dceb-4484-8b78-f617fae5ca43', 'multiverseId': 177343}, 'multiverseid': 177343}, {'name': 'Vignes de vapeur', 'text': 'Quand le terrain enchanté devient engagé, détruisez-le et ces Vignes de vapeur infligent 1 blessure au contrô-leur de ce terrain. Ce joueur déplace ces Vignes de vapeur sur un terrain de son choix.', 'type': 'Enchanter : terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176283&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b74e3a1-1af9-4544-800a-65126cee19f3', 'multiverseId': 176283}, 'multiverseid': 176283}, {'name': 'Viticci di Vapore', 'text': 'Quando la terra incantata diventa TAPpata, distruggila e i Viticci di Vapore infliggono 1 danno al controllore di quella terra. Quel giocatore sposta i Viticci di Vapore su una terra a propria scelta.', 'type': 'Incanta Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176792&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1b789cd-b3db-4d66-a3cf-37ec266112ac', 'multiverseId': 176792}, 'multiverseid': 176792}, {'name': '蒸気のつる', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b19c6f53-4e75-4d24-aa63-209b5cdcada8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Vinhas de Vapor', 'text': 'Quando o terreno encantado for virado, destrua-o e Vinhas de Vapor causa 1 ponto de dano ao controlador daquele terreno. Aquele jogador transfere Vinhas de Vapor para um terreno de sua própria escolha.', 'type': 'Encantar Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178786&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5238f76d-1efb-4252-b6c3-410cc0dd10b0', 'multiverseId': 178786}, 'multiverseid': 178786}]", "[{'name': 'Das Toben des Wurms', 'text': 'Bringe einen 6/6 grünen Wurmspielstein ins Spiel.\\nRückblende {3}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten spielen. Entferne sie dann ganz aus dem Spiel.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175974&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2555f6b-363f-4f45-9cae-9a066aa1e745', 'multiverseId': 175974}, 'multiverseid': 175974}, {'name': 'Rugido de la sierpe', 'text': 'Pon en juego una ficha de criatura Sierpe verde 6/6.\\nRetrospectiva {3}{G}. (Puedes jugar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego remuévela del juego.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177386&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3667430-e328-4980-92d8-8e8f1d171622', 'multiverseId': 177386}, 'multiverseid': 177386}, {'name': 'Rugissement de la guivre', 'text': 'Mettez en jeu un jeton de créature 6/6 verte Guivre.\\nFlashback {3}{G} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Retirez-la ensuite de la partie.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176326&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f766d9b-7b5e-4390-82cb-e4842f7c7667', 'multiverseId': 176326}, 'multiverseid': 176326}, {'name': 'Ruggito del Wurm', 'text': 'Metti in gioco una pedina creatura Wurm 6/6 verde.\\nFlashback {3}{G} (puoi giocare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi rimuovila dal gioco).', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176835&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be9a33f6-15af-43da-b6db-c82a32e28b47', 'multiverseId': 176835}, 'multiverseid': 176835}, {'name': 'ワームの咆哮', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ef81be8-dfc2-42ea-9846-ce79186e4162'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Rugido do Vorme', 'text': 'Coloque em jogo uma ficha de criatura verde 6/6 do tipo Vorme.\\nRecapitular {3}{G} (Você pode jogar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitulação. Depois remova-o do jogo.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178829&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd123639-8f10-43ed-a5d3-4d99f8dbc077', 'multiverseId': 178829}, 'multiverseid': 178829}]", "[{'name': 'Dematerialisieren', 'text': 'Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\nRückblende {5}{U}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten spielen. Entferne sie dann ganz aus dem Spiel.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175789&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc385ff0-e4db-4097-9b4c-c1aaba34e8c7', 'multiverseId': 175789}, 'multiverseid': 175789}, {'name': 'Desmaterializarse', 'text': 'Regresa el permanente objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\\nRetrospectiva {5}{U}{U}. (Puedes jugar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego remuévela del juego.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177201&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eeeaa115-6ede-4590-8a9a-0e9d6fc9fa0e', 'multiverseId': 177201}, 'multiverseid': 177201}, {'name': 'Dématérialisation', 'text': 'Renvoyez le permanent ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nFlashback {5}{U}{U} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Retirez-la ensuite de la partie.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176141&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbb70771-57f6-42d8-9ec6-47df0e0bbcfd', 'multiverseId': 176141}, 'multiverseid': 176141}, {'name': 'Smaterializzare', 'text': 'Il proprietario riprende in mano un permanente bersaglio.\\nFlashback {5}{U}{U} (puoi giocare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi rimuovila dal gioco).', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176650&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7846f4e-602f-4b4f-b238-ea1cc11de17c', 'multiverseId': 176650}, 'multiverseid': 176650}, {'name': '非物質化', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4bb83797-9fe7-4fcc-a8bc-909a359126d1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Desmaterializar', 'text': 'Devolve a permanente alvo para a mão de seu dono.\\nRecapitular {5}{U}{U} (Você pode jogar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitulação. Depois remova-o do jogo.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178644&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5717ce7e-2a48-4b9c-b580-372c14b1e7e0', 'multiverseId': 178644}, 'multiverseid': 178644}]", '[{\'name\': \'Demolieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Was meinem Schlag nicht widersteht das war wohl schlechte Qualität." —Schmiedelied der Zwerge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175891&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5208a9b8-ebef-48c0-94e5-297e226dbdb9\', \'multiverseId\': 175891}, \'multiverseid\': 175891}, {\'name\': \'Demoler\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Golpea el acero hasta que quede. ¿No da resultado? Hazlo pedazos." —Canción de forja enana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cabd622-c4c1-4f2c-9b9b-e670541e122e\', \'multiverseId\': 177303}, \'multiverseid\': 177303}, {\'name\': \'Démolition\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Frappe l\'acier, c\'est ton boulot A marche pas ? Casse en morceaux » —Chant des forgerons nains.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176243&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f2f0b21-0aac-4fca-b4bc-bc7d31a4de48\', \'multiverseId\': 176243}, \'multiverseid\': 176243}, {\'name\': \'Frantumare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Colpisci l\\\'acciaio fino a quando si piega. Non funziona? Fallo a pezzetti." —canzone di forgia nanesca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3e4a530-4af3-4080-9b50-848bccf1d8ef\', \'multiverseId\': 176752}, \'multiverseid\': 176752}, {\'name\': \'破砕\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c9e90c-a881-4a3b-aaba-23db57d850d5\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Demolir\', \'text\': \'Destrói o artefato ou o terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"P´ro aço amoldar malhamos, malhamos Se não funcionar? Estraçalhamos." — Canção dos anões na forjaria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85674a13-3e13-42da-8f15-69b38fa63260\', \'multiverseId\': 178746}, \'multiverseid\': 178746}]', "[{'name': 'Demoralisieren', 'text': 'Alle Kreaturen können in diesem Zug nur von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen geblockt werden.\\nGrenzwert Kreaturen können in diesem Zug nicht blocken. (Du hast den Grenzwert erreicht, falls sieben oder mehr Karten in deinem Friedhof sind.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175892&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6486268a-a287-4a9b-8a9a-50fb5937ec73', 'multiverseId': 175892}, 'multiverseid': 175892}, {'name': 'Desmoralizar', 'text': 'Cada criatura no puede ser bloqueada este turno excepto por dos o más criaturas.\\nUmbral Las criaturas no pueden bloquear este turno. (Tienes umbral mientras haya siete o más cartas en tu cementerio.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177304&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a5ebe23-33ef-4697-a722-89b6314e035d', 'multiverseId': 177304}, 'multiverseid': 177304}, {'name': 'Démoralisation', 'text': 'Chaque créature ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci excepté par deux créatures ou plus.\\nSeuil — Les créatures ne peuvent pas bloquer ce tour-ci. (Vous avez le seuil si sept cartes ou plus sont dans votre cimetière.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176244&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '350b890e-8cc2-41c4-b939-8c0e4ac514b3', 'multiverseId': 176244}, 'multiverseid': 176244}, {'name': 'Demoralizzare', 'text': 'Ciascuna creatura non può essere bloccata in questo turno tranne che da due o più creature.\\nSoglia - Le creature non possono bloccare in questo turno (hai soglia se ci sono almeno sette carte nel tuo cimitero).', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176753&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48f48f68-36b9-4daa-9d8d-3e7714499d28', 'multiverseId': 176753}, 'multiverseid': 176753}, {'name': '意気沮喪', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3e74275-8c10-458c-a04c-a20cc00953a0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Desmoralizar', 'text': 'Neste turno, cada criatura só pode ser bloqueada por duas ou mais criaturas.\\nLimiar — As criaturas não podem bloquear neste turno. (Você atinge o limiar se houver sete ou mais cards em seu cemitério.)', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178747&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '60127fee-9d07-40c8-bc47-259e43520fb6', 'multiverseId': 178747}, 'multiverseid': 178747}]", '[{\'name\': \'Denkfabrik\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst diese Karte auf deinen Friedhof legen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Zephaliden lernen nicht, um mehr zu wissen, sondern um mehr als andere zu wissen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175812&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0baeaee-0ae9-4494-82fe-7b62b7252c15\', \'multiverseId\': 175812}, \'multiverseid\': 175812}, {\'name\': \'Grupo de expertos\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, mira la carta de la parte superior de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Los cefálidos no buscan el conocimiento para superarse, sino para superar a otros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d6545a1-52a1-4d99-bc9b-bd0549908a24\', \'multiverseId\': 177224}, \'multiverseid\': 177224}, {\'name\': "Comité d\'experts", \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte dans votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Les céphalides ne recherchent pas la connaissance pour s\'améliorer, mais pour améliorer les autres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176164&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'876a3cc3-c7c2-4647-8a1a-dd07e4dad32e\', \'multiverseId\': 176164}, \'multiverseid\': 176164}, {\'name\': \'Cisterna di Pensieri\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'I cefalidi non cercano la conoscenza per migliorarsi, bensì per avere la meglio sugli altri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab85fd3e-bd79-4231-8a57-24426d2fb953\', \'multiverseId\': 176673}, \'multiverseid\': 176673}, {\'name\': \'頭脳集団\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ae003df-7f74-4089-976e-81d2c0870b54\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Reservatório de Pensamentos\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocá-lo em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os cefálidas não procuram conhecimento para se aprimorarem, mas para superar os outros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfb91b7d-7ea1-4ebb-8e73-ab3a45e016b8\', \'multiverseId\': 178667}, \'multiverseid\': 178667}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dezimieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl und ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Jeder kann Schöpfung bewundern. Doch nur ein Barbar kann auch das Schöne in der Zerstörung bewundern." —Kamahl, Grubenkämpfer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175995&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66ebfa7c-52a8-475f-a337-e5c89a29d534\', \'multiverseId\': 175995}, \'multiverseid\': 175995}, {\'name\': \'Diezmar\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto objetivo, la criatura objetivo, el encantamiento objetivo y la tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cualquiera puede admirar la creación. Sólo un bárbaro ve la belleza en la demolición." —Kamahl, luchador del foso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e0f1866-cc3d-4bc9-9a04-07691a311b53\', \'multiverseId\': 177407}, \'multiverseid\': 177407}, {\'name\': \'Décimation\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé, la créature ciblée, l\'enchantement ciblé et le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Tout le monde peut admirer la création. Seul un barbare voit la beauté de la destruction. » —Kamahl, sangrahbaire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176347&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68bd5dab-8369-434a-b75a-91ba030ca7dd\', \'multiverseId\': 176347}, \'multiverseid\': 176347}, {\'name\': \'Decimare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio, una creatura bersaglio, un incantesimo bersaglio e una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Chiunque può ammirare la creazione. Solo un barbaro comprende la bellezza della distruzione". —Kamahl, combattente dell\\\'arena\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c110a937-743d-4ec5-9182-8f2940c48295\', \'multiverseId\': 176856}, \'multiverseid\': 176856}, {\'name\': \'大量破壊\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fad7ba76-003a-445b-8e79-67a9f449e756\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Dizimar\', \'text\': \'Destrói o artefato alvo, a criatura alvo, o encantamento alvo e o terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Qualquer um pode admirar uma criação, mas apenas os bárbaros veêm a beleza na demolição." —Kamahl, lutador da liça\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b48cd17-386a-438b-8f60-c3237edd9765\', \'multiverseId\': 178850}, \'multiverseid\': 178850}]', '[{\'name\': \'Druidendichter\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}, opfere den Druidendichter: Zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Die Druiden und die Wälder sind in perfekter Harmonie. Sie singen die selben Lieder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175946&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a88926a2-bef2-4024-a748-1f6a2c383bf7\', \'multiverseId\': 175946}, \'multiverseid\': 175946}, {\'name\': \'Druida lirista\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}, sacrificar el Druida lirista: Destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida\', \'flavor\': \'Los druidas y el bosque están en perfecta armonía. Cantan las mismas canciones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'728c74b6-4a2f-4d90-83c4-51f6400f5811\', \'multiverseId\': 177358}, \'multiverseid\': 177358}, {\'name\': \'Lyriste druide\', \'text\': "{G}, {T}, sacrifiez le Lyriste druide : Détruisez l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : druide\', \'flavor\': \'Les druides et la forêt sont en parfaite harmonie. Ils chantent la même chanson.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176298&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b267066-bba7-4892-bc27-bb06fa7ad627\', \'multiverseId\': 176298}, \'multiverseid\': 176298}, {\'name\': \'Lirico Druido\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}, Sacrifica il Lirico Druido: Distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido\', \'flavor\': \'I druidi e la foresta sono in perfetta armonia. Cantano la stessa canzone.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'537fb014-7ba0-4b5d-9d94-da5723fd87af\', \'multiverseId\': 176807}, \'multiverseid\': 176807}, {\'name\': \'ドルイドの抒情詩人\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59169346-fc99-4525-b974-6c1c78770ec4\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Druida Lirista\', \'text\': \'{G}, {T}, Sacrifique Druida Lirista: Destrói o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida\', \'flavor\': \'Os druidas e a floresta estão em perfeita harmonia. Eles cantam as mesmas canções.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ea4cc9b-320f-42be-bd0f-2f4ee6122552\', \'multiverseId\': 178801}, \'multiverseid\': 178801}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkelwasser-Ei\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, opfere das Dunkelwasser-Ei: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U}{B}. Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Dürstet es dich nach Wissen, unabhängig vom Preis?" —Watnik, Glasbläsermeister\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176007&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb0fe91f-d661-4600-9be8-e7a2dc73c456\', \'multiverseId\': 176007}, \'multiverseid\': 176007}, {\'name\': \'Huevo Aguanegra\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Huevo Aguanegra: Agrega {U}{B} a tu reserva de maná. Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Ansías el conocimiento sin importar el precio?" —Wátnik, soplavidrio experto\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96af025a-3a70-4ba0-bbd1-5b1efb609046\', \'multiverseId\': 177419}, \'multiverseid\': 177419}, {\'name\': \'Œuf de Sombreau\', \'text\': "{2}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Œuf de Sombreau : Ajoutez {U}{B} à votre réserve. Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Êtes-vous prêt à payer le prix de la puissance ? » —Warnik, maître souffleur de verre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176359&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1de5d6b6-8cd7-445b-86d4-18bb704f7b34\', \'multiverseId\': 176359}, \'multiverseid\': 176359}, {\'name\': \'Uovo di Acquascura\', \'text\': "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Uovo di Acquascura: Aggiungi {U}{B} alla tua riserva di mana. Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Vuoi accumulare conoscenza senza preoccuparti delle conseguenze?" —Watnik, mastro vetraio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03931b63-e4ea-49ad-97de-ac9fb7c09543\', \'multiverseId\': 176868}, \'multiverseid\': 176868}, {\'name\': \'ダークウォーターの卵\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d21032ca-45b8-4059-a810-fd4b55b47913\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ovo de Darkwater\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, Sacrifique Ovo de Darkwater: Adiciona {U}{B} a sua reserva de mana. Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Tens sede de conhecimento não importa a que custo?" — Watnik, mestre vidreiro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a84d7cc-daf1-4919-b279-b3486ab20c36\', \'multiverseId\': 178862}, \'multiverseid\': 178862}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkelwasser-Katakomben\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Schlammige Wellen an der Küste Otarias verbergen die vergessenen Überreste des Krieges mit den Phyrexianern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176027&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bb61af0-9169-4b57-be38-2c2b61ca963e\', \'multiverseId\': 176027}, \'multiverseid\': 176027}, {\'name\': \'Catacumbas Aguanegra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{B} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Las lóbregas mareas otarianas esconden las traiciones olvidadas de la guerra pirexiana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eef18a9a-ab99-457e-885b-136f793b9aed\', \'multiverseId\': 177439}, \'multiverseid\': 177439}, {\'name\': \'Catacombes de Sombreau\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Ajoutez {U}{B} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les boueuses vagues d\'Otaria cachent les horreurs oubliées de la guerre phyrexiane.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176379&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ddcbef5-c565-47fd-8234-797a5d59a54c\', \'multiverseId\': 176379}, \'multiverseid\': 176379}, {\'name\': \'Catacombe di Acquascura\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{B} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Le fosche maree di Otaria celano allo sguardo i tradimenti dimenticati della guerra di Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05dcb4c8-c2a8-4015-a572-de940ccecfe8\', \'multiverseId\': 176888}, \'multiverseid\': 176888}, {\'name\': \'ダークウォーターの地下墓地\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a45ad251-c81e-4846-8e2c-5e18e5ea4e1e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Catacumbas de Darkwater\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adiciona {U}{B} a sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'As marés lodosas Otarianas ocultam as traições esquecidas da guerra Phyrexiana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc1d1c8f-00c3-4ddd-a123-5f4d22d34361\', \'multiverseId\': 178882}, \'multiverseid\': 178882}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerungsbold\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bold\', \'flavor\': \'Es verachtet Menschen und Eichhörnchen und Bestien und Zwerge und Zephaliden... tja, eigentlich verachtet es alles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=175839&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9ab68f9-fb66-43e3-af68-96fc3907143c\', \'multiverseId\': 175839}, \'multiverseid\': 175839}, {\'name\': \'Diablillo del crepúsculo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablillo\', \'flavor\': \'Desprecia a los humanos y a las ardillas y a las bestias y a los enanos y a los cefálidos. Bueno, desprecia prácticamente todo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dcf57f9-770e-4564-913d-4bebf2ecd6dd\', \'multiverseId\': 177251}, \'multiverseid\': 177251}, {\'name\': \'Diablotin du crépuscule\', \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature : diablotin\', \'flavor\': \'Il méprise les humains et les écureuils et les bêtes et les nains et les céphalides... Bref il méprise à peu près tout.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176191&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d869900-bfd0-4fb4-9f00-6dfe3439f015\', \'multiverseId\': 176191}, \'multiverseid\': 176191}, {\'name\': \'Demonietto del Crepuscolo\', \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demonietto\', \'flavor\': "Odia gli uomini e gli scoiattoli e le bestie e i nani e i cefalidi. . . be\', odia praticamente tutto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'384f8143-f0a2-4d7b-b061-b6ead22b671f\', \'multiverseId\': 176700}, \'multiverseid\': 176700}, {\'name\': \'薄暮のインプ\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a468bab1-9ba2-4ad7-babb-fb8ecf444768\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Diabrete da Penumbra\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diabrete\', \'flavor\': \'Ele despreza os seres humanos e esquilos e bestas e anões e cefálidas ... bem, ele despreza quase tudo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=178694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59edae95-09fb-43ec-9f37-8ad027b2fde6\', \'multiverseId\': 178694}, \'multiverseid\': 178694}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176039&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3f10e666-826d-4725-9cab-6ac900548458', 'multiverseId': 176039}, 'multiverseid': 176039}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177451&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3171c2f0-5039-464b-89cf-27300d7480d0', 'multiverseId': 177451}, 'multiverseid': 177451}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176391&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1e43a60-c537-4506-b12f-f3f7503eb002', 'multiverseId': 176391}, 'multiverseid': 176391}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=176900&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifier