ic Wurm gets +4/+4. (You have threshold as long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'Threshold Mystic Visionary has flying. (You have threshold as long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'Threshold Mystic Zealot gets +1/+1 and has flying. (You have threshold as long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'Threshold Springing Tiger gets +2/+2. (You have threshold as long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'Threshold o1o\\nB, oc\\nT, Remove two cards in your graveyard from the game: Target player discards a card from his or her hand. Play this ability only any time you could play a sorcery. (Play this ability only if seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'Timberland Ruins comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT, Sacrifice Timberland Ruins: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', 'Trample\\nGorilla Titan gets +4/+4 as long as there are no cards in your graveyard.', 'Trample\\nSavage Firecat comes into play with seven +1/+1 counters on it.\\nWhenever you tap a land for mana, remove a +1/+1 counter from Savage Firecat.', "Trample\\nTerravore's power and toughness are each equal to the number of land cards in all graveyards.", 'Trample\\nThreshold o1o\\nG: Regenerate Krosan Avenger. (Play this ability only if seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'U', 'Untap target creature. After this phase, there is an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase.\\nFlashback o2o\\nR (You may play this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then remove it from the game.)', 'Until end of turn, whenever target creature deals damage, you gain that much life.\\nDraw a card.', 'Volcanic Spray deals 1 damage to each creature without flying and each player.\\nFlashback o1o\\nR (You may play this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then remove it from the game.)', 'Volley of Boulders deals 6 damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures and/or players.\\nFlashback o\\nRo\\nRo\\nRo\\nRo\\nRo\\nR (You may play this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then remove it from the game.)', 'W', 'When Anarchist comes into play, you may return target sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Auramancer comes into play, you may return target enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Cartographer comes into play, you may return target land card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Dwarven Recruiter comes into play, search your library for any number of Dwarf cards and reveal those cards. Shuffle your library, then put them on top of it in any order.', 'When Gravedigger comes into play, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "When Ground Seal comes into play, draw a card.\\nCards in graveyards can't be the targets of spells or abilities.", 'When Mindslicer is put into a graveyard from play, each player discards his or her hand.', 'When Minotaur Explorer comes into play, sacrifice it unless you discard a card at random from your hand.', "When Phantom Whelp attacks or blocks, return it to its owner's hand at end of combat.", 'When Scrivener comes into play, you may return target instant card from your graveyard to your hand.', "When a player plays a spell, sacrifice Standstill. If you do, each of that player's opponents draws three cards.", "When enchanted land becomes tapped, destroy it and Steam Vines deals 1 damage to that land's controller. That player moves Steam Vines to a land of his or her choice.", 'Whenever Balshan Beguiler deals combat damage to a player, that player reveals the top two cards of his or her library. You choose one of those cards and put it into his or her graveyard.', 'Whenever Filthy Cur is dealt damage, you lose that much life.', 'Whenever Pianna, Nomad Captain attacks, attacking creatures get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Rabid Elephant becomes blocked, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn for each creature blocking it.', 'Whenever Rotting Giant attacks or blocks, sacrifice it unless you remove a card in your graveyard from the game.', 'Whenever Spark Mage deals combat damage to a player, you may have Spark Mage deal 1 damage to target creature that player controls.', 'Whenever Stone-Tongue Basilisk deals combat damage to a creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.\\nThreshold All creatures able to block Stone-Tongue Basilisk do so. (You have threshold as long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', "Whenever Zombie Cannibal deals combat damage to a player, you may remove target card in that player's graveyard from the game.", 'Whenever a creature attacks, flip a coin. If you win the flip, the next time that creature would deal combat damage this turn, it deals double that damage instead. If you lose the flip, the next time that creature would deal combat damage this turn, prevent that damage.', "Whenever a creature blocks, Battle Strain deals 1 damage to that creature's controller.", "Whenever a creature is put into a graveyard from play, that creature's controller sacrifices a land.", "Whenever a green nontoken creature is put into a graveyard from play, that creature's controller may search his or her library for a card with the same name as that creature and put it into play. If that player does, he or she then shuffles his or her library.", 'Whenever a land card is put into your graveyard from your library, you may pay o1. If you do, draw a card.', 'Whenever a player discards a card from his or her hand, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a spell, Dwarven Shrine deals X damage to that player, where X is twice the number of cards in all graveyards with the same name as that spell.', 'Whenever a player plays a spell, counter that spell unless that player pays o\\nX, where X is the number of cards in all graveyards with the same name as the spell.', 'Whenever a player plays a spell, that player discards X cards from his or her hand, where X is the number of cards in all graveyards with the same name as that spell.', 'Whenever a player plays a spell, that player gains X life, where X is the number of cards in all graveyards with the same name as that spell.', 'Whenever a player plays a spell, that player may pay o2. If the player does, he or she draws a card.', 'Whenever a player plays a spell, that player puts X 1/1 green Squirrel creature tokens into play, where X is the number of cards in all graveyards with the same name as that spell.', "Whenever a player taps a land for mana during another player's turn, destroy that land.", 'Whenever a spell or ability an opponent controls destroys a noncreature permanent you control, you may destroy target permanent that opponent controls.', 'Whenever enchanted creature is dealt damage, its controller puts that many 1/1 green Squirrel creature tokens into play.', 'Whenever you play an instant or sorcery spell, you may pay o3. If you do, put a copy of that spell onto the stack. You may choose new targets for that copy.', 'Whenever you win a coin flip, put a luck counter on Chance Encounter.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if Chance Encounter has ten or more luck counters on it, you win the game.', 'White creatures get +1/+1.\\nThreshold White creatures get an additional +1/+1. (You have threshold as long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'You control enchanted creature.', 'You draw two cards, then each other player draws a card.', 'You gain 2 life for each card in your graveyard.\\nFlashback o9o\\nWo\\nWo\\nW (You may play this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then remove it from the game.)', 'o1, oc\\nT: Add o\\nBo\\nR to your mana pool.', 'o1, oc\\nT: Add o\\nGo\\nW to your mana pool.', 'o1, oc\\nT: Add o\\nRo\\nG to your mana pool.', 'o1, oc\\nT: Add o\\nUo\\nB to your mana pool.', 'o1, oc\\nT: Add o\\nWo\\nU to your mana pool.', 'o1: The next time an instant or sorcery spell would deal damage to you this turn, that spell deals that damage to its controller instead.', 'o1o\\nB, Remove a card in your graveyard from the game: Screams of the Damned deals 1 damage to each creature and each player.', 'o1o\\nB, Sacrifice Famished Ghoul: Remove up to two target cards in a single graveyard from the game.', 'o1o\\nBo\\nB, Sacrifice a creature: Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'o1o\\nG, Remove two cards in your graveyard from the game: Put a 2/2 green Bear creature token into play.', "o1o\\nG, Sacrifice Diligent Farmhand: Search your library for a basic land card and put that card into play tapped. Then shuffle your library.\\nIf Diligent Farmhand is in a graveyard, Muscle Burst's effect counts it as a Muscle Burst.", 'o1o\\nG, Sacrifice Twigwalker: Two target creatures each get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'o1o\\nR, oc\\nT: Chainflinger deals 1 damage to target creature or player.\\nThreshold o2o\\nR, oc\\nT: Chainflinger deals 2 damage to target creature or player. (Play this ability only if seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'o1o\\nR, oc\\nT: Put a mine counter on target land.\\nWhenever a land with a mine counter on it becomes tapped, destroy it.\\nWhen Mine Layer leaves play, remove all mine counters from all lands.', 'o1o\\nR: Ashen Firebeast deals 1 damage to each creature without flying.', 'o2, Remove a card in your hand from the game: Return target card from your graveyard to your hand if it shares a type with the card removed this way. (The card types are artifact, creature, enchantment, instant, land, and sorcery.)', 'o2, Sacrifice Limestone Golem: Target player draws a card.', 'o2, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Darkwater Egg: Add o\\nUo\\nB to your mana pool. Draw a card.', 'o2, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Mossfire Egg: Add o\\nRo\\nG to your mana pool. Draw a card.', 'o2, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Shadowblood Egg: Add o\\nBo\\nR to your mana pool. Draw a card.', 'o2, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Skycloud Egg: Add o\\nWo\\nU to your mana pool. Draw a card.', 'o2, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Sungrass Egg: Add o\\nGo\\nW to your mana pool. Draw a card.', "o2o\\nB, Discard a card from your hand: Face of Fear can't be blocked this turn except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.", 'o2o\\nB, Sacrifice a creature: Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.\\no2o\\nB, Remove a creature card in your graveyard from the game: Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'o2o\\nB: Infected Vermin deals 1 damage to each creature and each player.\\nThreshold o3o\\nB: Infected Vermin deals 3 damage to each creature and each player. (Play this ability only if seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', "o2o\\nG, oc\\nT: Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is that creature's power.", 'o2o\\nR, Sacrifice Barbarian Lunatic: Barbarian Lunatic deals 2 damage to target creature.', 'o3, oc\\nT: Remove target card in a graveyard from the game.\\no1, Sacrifice Steamclaw: Remove target card in a graveyard from the game.', "o3o\\nG, oc\\nT: Reveal the top card of your library. If it's a creature card, put it into play. Otherwise, put it into your graveyard.", 'o3o\\nU, Remove Shifty Doppelganger from the game: Put a creature card from your hand into play. That creature gains haste until end of turn. At end of turn, sacrifice that creature. If you do, return Shifty Doppelganger to play.', 'o\\nB, Discard a card from your hand: Fledgling Imp gains flying until end of turn.', "o\\nB, Discard a card from your hand: Regenerate Dirty Wererat.\\nThreshold Dirty Wererat gets +2/+2 and can't block. (You have threshold as long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)", "o\\nG, Discard a card from your hand: Crashing Centaur gains trample until end of turn.\\nThreshold Crashing Centaur gets +2/+2 and can't be the target of spells or abilities. (You have threshold as long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)", 'o\\nG, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Druid Lyrist: Destroy target enchantment.', 'o\\nG, oc\\nT: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "o\\nGo\\nG: Still Life becomes a 4/3 Centaur creature until end of turn. It's still an enchantment.", 'o\\nR, Discard a card at random from your hand: Frenetic Ogre gets +3/+0 until end of turn.', 'o\\nR, Discard a card at random from your hand: Pardic Swordsmith gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'o\\nR, Sacrifice a land: Magma Vein deals 1 damage to each creature without flying.', 'o\\nU, oc\\nT: Tap or untap target creature.', 'o\\nUo\\nU: Tap target creature without flying.', 'o\\nW, Sacrifice Dedicated Martyr: You gain 3 life.', 'o\\nW, oc\\nT: Tap target creature.\\nThreshold o\\nWo\\nW, oc\\nT: Tap two target creatures. (Play this ability only if seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'o\\nW, oc\\nT: Target permanent you control gains protection from instant spells and from sorcery spells until end of turn.', 'o\\nW: Luminous Guardian gets +0/+1 until end of turn.\\no2: Luminous Guardian may block an additional creature this turn.', "o\\nX: Testament of Faith becomes an X/X Wall creature until end of turn. It's still an enchantment. (Walls can't attack.)", 'oc\\nT, Put the top card of your library into your graveyard: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.', "oc\\nT, Put the top card of your library into your graveyard: For each colored mana symbol in that card's mana cost, add one mana of that color to your mana pool. Play this ability only any time you could play an instant. (For example, if the card's mana cost is o3o\\nUo\\nUo\\nB, you add o\\nUo\\nUo\\nB to your mana pool.)", 'oc\\nT, Remove any number of cards in your graveyard from the game: Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of cards removed this way.', "oc\\nT, Remove two cards in your graveyard and Zombie Assassin from the game: Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'oc\\nT, Sacrifice two lands and Sandstone Deadfall: Destroy target attacking creature.', 'oc\\nT: Add o1o\\nG to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nB to your mana pool. Cabal Pit deals 1 damage to you.\\nThreshold o\\nB, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Cabal Pit: Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn. (Play this ability only if seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool. Centaur Garden deals 1 damage to you.\\nThreshold o\\nG, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Centaur Garden: Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn. (Play this ability only if seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool.\\nThreshold Werebear gets +3/+3. (You have threshold as long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nR to your mana pool. Barbarian Ring deals 1 damage to you.\\nThreshold o\\nR, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Barbarian Ring: Barbarian Ring deals 2 damage to target creature or player. (Play this ability only if seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nU to your mana pool. Cephalid Coliseum deals 1 damage to you.\\nThreshold o\\nU, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Cephalid Coliseum: Target player draws three cards, then discards three cards from his or her hand. (Play this ability only if seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nW to your mana pool. Nomad Stadium deals 1 damage to you.\\nThreshold o\\nW, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Nomad Stadium: You gain 4 life. (Play this ability only if seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\no1, oc\\nT: Untap target land.', 'oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\no5, oc\\nT: Add o\\nWo\\nUo\\nBo\\nRo\\nG to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT, Sacrifice Petrified Field: Return target land card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool. Tarnished Citadel deals 3 damage to you.', 'oc\\nT: Destroy target creature token.', 'oc\\nT: Prevent the next 2 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.\\nThreshold oc\\nT: Prevent the next 4 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn. (Play this ability only if seven or more cards are in your graveyard.)', 'oc\\nT: Put a fuse counter on target creature.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a fuse counter on each creature with a fuse counter on it.\\nWhenever a creature has four or more fuse counters on it, remove all fuse counters from it and destroy it. That creature deals 4 damage to its controller.', 'oc\\nT: Target player draws a card, then discards a card from his or her hand.', 'oc\\nT: Target player draws two cards, then discards two cards from his or her hand.', 'oc\\nT: Whipkeeper deals damage to target creature equal to the damage already dealt to it this turn.']
